ion scandal that was partly related to Qatar’s disputed victory in bidding for the 2022 World Cup.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CREWE, England — After 88 years and more than 3,000 matches, Harold Finch thought he had seen everything, but Sunday was a rare event. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/01/sports/01SOCCER/01SOCCER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 455, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/01/sports/01SOCCER/01SOCCER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 455}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/01/sports/01SOCCER/01SOCCER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 776, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/01/sports/01SOCCER/01SOCCER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1552, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/01/sports/01SOCCER/01SOCCER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/01/sports/01SOCCER/01SOCCER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/01/sports/01SOCCER/01SOCCER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In England, Qatar Faces Northern Ireland in a Most Unusual Match', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In England, Qatar Faces Northern Ireland in a Most Unusual Match', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Montague, Jason', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Federation of Association Football (FIFA)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bribery and Kickbacks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Qatar', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Cup 2022 (Soccer)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Northern Ireland', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-01T03:04:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Montague', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Montague', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d3da8147-6be1-54d0-b558-30e55dc4438d', 'word_count': 1108, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d3da8147-6be1-54d0-b558-30e55dc4438d'}, {'abstract': 'The vocal ensemble tackled Orazio Vecchi’s madrigal comedy at the West End Theater, and attempted to soften some its more dated humor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/02/arts/review-the-western-wind-performs-lamfiparnaso-at-a-distance.html', 'snippet': 'The vocal ensemble tackled Orazio Vecchi’s madrigal comedy at the West End Theater, and attempted to soften some its more dated humor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At its premiere in Modena, Italy, in 1594, Orazio Vecchi’s “L’Amfiparnaso” must have been a barrel of laughs. The characters in this madrigal comedy are a mix of stock figures from commedia dell’arte, supplemented by caricatures with foreign manners and silly accents: a preening Spaniard, a wily servant from Bergamo and that mainstay of Italian Renaissance thigh-slapping hilarity, Jews babbling among themselves in synagogue. There are also serious scenes of true love tested and a happy ending, all skillfully woven into a sequence of five-part madrigals. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: The Western Wind Performs ‘L’Amfiparnaso’ at a Distance', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Comedy Rendered in Song, Mime and Tempered Tones ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'West End Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vecchi, Orazio', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': "L'Amfiparnaso (Movie)", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Western Wind', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-01T03:21:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Corinna da Fonseca-Wollheim', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/05220d1d-cbc7-5fca-8c32-05bc3e07f2d4', 'word_count': 425, 'uri': 'nyt://article/05220d1d-cbc7-5fca-8c32-05bc3e07f2d4'}, {'abstract': 'Jon Snow faced off with a fierce opponent and Tyrion and Daenerys sparred over wine.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/05/31/game-of-thrones-recap-white-walker-attack-season-5/', 'snippet': 'Jon Snow faced off with a fierce opponent and Tyrion and Daenerys sparred over wine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Season 5, Episode 8, “Hardhome”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': 