_count': 588, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eb6b03ce-06e3-557e-8184-12f30925f999'}, {'abstract': 'Knee-jerk support for veterans has resulted in harmful policy choices.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/01/opinion/the-risk-of-over-thanking-our-veterans.html', 'snippet': 'Knee-jerk support for veterans has resulted in harmful policy choices.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TRAVELING through an airport recently, I witnessed a now-commonplace ritual: military personnel getting head-of-the-line privileges in the boarding area. As we complete the withdrawal of American troops from Afghanistan, one of the legacies of the longest war in our history is how the public has rallied to support those who served.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/01/opinion/01Harbaugh/01Harbaugh-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1428, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/01/opinion/01Harbaugh/01Harbaugh-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1428}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/01/opinion/01Harbaugh/01Harbaugh-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 431, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/01/opinion/01Harbaugh/01Harbaugh-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 861, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/01/opinion/01Harbaugh/01Harbaugh-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/01/opinion/01Harbaugh/01Harbaugh-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumb