 not 100 percent yet.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/01/tracy-morgan-says-he-doesnt-remember-accident/', 'snippet': 'In his first interview since the deadly accident last year, the comedian told the “Today” show, “Right now my goal is just to heal and get better. Because I’m not 100 percent yet.”', 'lead_paragraph': ' In his first television interview since he was badly injured in a highway crash last year, an emotional Tracy Morgan told NBC’s “Today” show that he did not remember the accident and was not yet ready to return to his comedy career. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/02/arts/01artsbeat-tracymorgan2/01artsbeat-tracymorgan2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/02/arts/01artsbeat-tracymorgan2/01artsbeat-tracymorgan2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/02/arts/01artsbeat-tracymorgan2/01artsbeat-tracymorgan2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/02/arts/01artsbeat-tracymorgan2/01artsbeat-tracymorgan2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/02/arts/01artsbeat-tracymorgan2/01artsbeat-tracymorgan2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/02/arts/01artsbeat-tracymorgan2/01artsbeat-tracymorgan2-thumbStanda