2c', 'word_count': 532, 'uri': 'nyt://article/be530ef7-2ce0-5a11-ad82-5b0f1ce6622c'}, {'abstract': 'Better Markets, which fights for more restrictions on Wall Street, is hiring Frank Medina, a senior lawyer with the Republican-led House Financial Services Committee.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/02/business/dealbook/consumer-group-better-markets-hires-away-top-house-aide.html', 'snippet': 'Better Markets, which fights for more restrictions on Wall Street, is hiring Frank Medina, a senior lawyer with the Republican-led House Financial Services Committee.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Consumer advocates often bemoan Washington’s revolving door between government and industry, but one group is taking a page out of that playbook to make a seemingly counterintuitive hire.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Consumer Group Better Markets Hires Away Top House Aide', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dodd-Frank Wall Street Reform and Consumer Protection Act (2010)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Better Markets Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House Financial Services Committee', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Medina, Frank A', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-02T02:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Eavis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eavis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d47e4b61-d446-5a1b-9361-59f6ed80ef4f', 'word_count': 480, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d47e4b61-d446-5a1b-9361-59f6ed80ef4f'}, {'abstract': 'Monday’s rapprochemen