leaded not guilty to using the card to buy a diamond ring online.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A New York City police officer was arrested on Tuesday and charged with stealing a dead man’s credit card and using it to buy a diamond ring. She pleaded not guilty on Tuesday afternoon.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Police Officer Charged With Using Dead Man’s Credit Card', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Officer Charged in Use of Dead Man&#8217;s Card', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pierre, Ymmacula (1984- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Robberies and Thefts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Identity Theft', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit Cards', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-03T02:44:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Mueller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mueller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8c625677-eb91-5dc0-a4d8-b3a2524243ce', 'word_count': 303, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8c625677-eb91-5dc0-a4d8-b3a2524243ce'}, {'abstract': 'Masahiro Tanaka will be back pitching Wednesday, and if his elbow blows out now, it is likely too late for him to be able to return next season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/03/sports/baseball/all-in-on-tanaka-yankees-can-only-hope-his-elbow-holds-up.html', 'snippet': 'Masahiro Tanaka will be back pitching Wednesday, and if his elbow blows out now, it is likely too late for him to be able to return next season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEATTLE — After taking a month off to rest and recover from tightness in his right wrist, Masahiro Tanaka pronounced himself fit and ready, so the Yankees will saddle him up Wednesday against the Seattle Mariners and see how far they can ride him. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/sports/CITY-TANAKA/CITY-TANAKA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 409, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/03/sports/CITY-TANAKA/CITY-TANAKA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 409}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/sports/CITY-TANAKA/CITY-TANAKA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/sports/CITY-TANAKA/CITY-TANAKA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1397, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/sports/CITY-TANAKA/CITY-TANAKA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/03/sports/CITY-TANAKA/CITY-TANAKA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/sports/CITY-TANAKA/CITY-TANAKA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_