e straight as a board in an effort to protect his back as much as possible. When he stands, it often feels achy and tight and uncomfortable.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/sports/CITY-WRIGHT/CITY-WRIGHT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 962, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/03/sports/CITY-WRIGHT/CITY-WRIGHT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 962}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/sports/CITY-WRIGHT/CITY-WRIGHT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 639, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/sports/CITY-WRIGHT/CITY-WRIGHT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1278, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/sports/CITY-WRIGHT/CITY-WRIGHT-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/03/sports/CITY-WRIGHT/CITY-WRIGHT-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/sports/CITY-WRIGHT/CITY-WRIGHT-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Uncertainty Clouds David Wright’s Potential Return to Mets', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Uncertainty Clouds 2 Returns', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', '