: 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/t-magazine/14beauty-look-updo-1/14beauty-look-updo-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/t-magazine/14beauty-look-updo-1/14beauty-look-updo-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/t-magazine/14beauty-look-updo-1/14beauty-look-updo-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/14/t-magazine/14beauty-look-updo-1/14beauty-look-updo-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/t-magazine/14beauty-look-updo-1/14beauty-look-updo-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Onwards and Upwards', 'kicker': 'On Beauty', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Onwards and Upwards', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hair', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-03T04:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dayna Tortorici', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dayna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tortorici', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/223c1826-5301-5b3d-9790-d935e7093b15', 'word_count': 529, 'uri': 'nyt://article/223c1826-5301-5b3d-9790-d935e7093b15'}, {'abstract': 'The musician Tyondai Braxton’s “Hive” show will take place over three nights at the New York venue the Kitchen.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/03/t-magazine/a-sneak-peek-at-a-futuristic-multimedia-performance.html', 'snippet': 'The musician Tyondai Braxton’s “Hive” show will take place over three nights at the New York venue the Kitchen.', 'lead_paragraph': '“In a lot of a visual art, you complete the project, and by the time you present it, it’s done,” says Tyondai Braxton, whose multimedia project “Hive” will be the centerpiece of an upcoming three-night residency at the New York venue the Kitchen. After a pause, he admits: “But maybe you’d want to have it completely completed when you play the Guggenheim.” Braxton is the former frontman of the experimental indie-rock band Battles, as well as a performer with two decades of experience in the New York music world. “Hive” did indeed have its first show in at the Guggenheim in 2013, for which it was originally commissioned, before making stops at locations including the Sydney Opera House, the MONA FOMA festival in Tasmania and the Barbican Centre in London. Now, Braxton is ready to unveil the finished product. “I feel like I’ve arrived at the first incarnation of what I want this to be,” he says. “Everyone understands the music, understands the vibe of it, and we’re really interfacing in a way that’s exciting.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Sneak Peek at a Futuristic Multimedia Performance', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-06-03T04:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nathan Reese', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Reese', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/30036856-95d1-563c-97d6-5a1f9d2aa5e8', 'word_count': 405, 'uri': 'nyt://article/30036856-95d1-563c-97d6-5a1f9d2aa5e8'}, {'abstract': 'This season, the often black and understated shoes have graduated to showstopper status.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/03/t-magazine/chelsea-boots-2-0.html', 'snippet': 'This season, the often black and understated shoes have graduated to showstopper status.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This season, the often black and understated shoes have graduated to showstopper status.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/t-magazine/03market-koh/03market-koh-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/03/t-magazine/03market-koh/03market-koh-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/t-magazine/03market-koh/03market-koh-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/t-magazine/03market-koh/03market-koh-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/t-magazine/03market-koh/03market-koh-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/03/t-magazine/03market-koh/03market-koh-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 