0, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2bdae13d-6aae-56e8-8ad4-b399b8a96d36'}, {'abstract': 'The City Columnist Ginia Bellafante reflects on interest in Wednesday Martin’s book, “Primates of Park Avenue.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/times-insider/2015/06/03/primates-of-park-avenue-reporters-notebook/', 'snippet': 'The City Columnist Ginia Bellafante reflects on interest in Wednesday Martin’s book, “Primates of Park Avenue.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Wednesday Martin, a writer I had never heard of, published an Op-Ed essay in The Times a few weeks ago about Upper East Side mothers, readers responded with great interest across the digital universe. Most hadn’t read the book on which the essay was based — its publication date was June 2 — but everyone seemed to have an opinion. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/01/us/motherlode-primates/motherlode-primates-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/01/us/motherlode-primates/motherlode-primates-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/01/us/motherlode-primates/motherlode-primates-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/01/us/motherlode-primates/motherlode-primates-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/01/us/motherlode-primates/motherlode-primates-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard',