asia/in-hindi-films-strong-women-are-a-formula-that-works.html', 'snippet': 'The most popular Hindi films in recent months have been led by women. They have been made for the purest reason in commercial cinema: They make money.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the hit Hindi film of the season, an architect cares for her cantankerous father, enduring his careful analysis of his own constipation, his contempt for marriage, which he claims is for “low I.Q. people,” and his appreciation for the fact, which he shares with others, that his unmarried daughter’s sex life is purely “need based.” In another Hindi film, a woman who is estranged from her husband flirts with available men, bringing much misery to their lives.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Hindi Films, Strong Women Are a Formula That Works', 'kicker': 'Letter From India', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-03T14:16:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manu Joseph', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Manu', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Joseph', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e14789d-e152-5512-8de3-33c79d1467c9', 'word_count': 688, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e14789d-e152-5512-8de3-33c79d1467c9'}, {'abstract': 'The gift from Mr. Paulson, a billionaire hedge fund manager, is the largest in the university’s history.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/04/education/john-paulson-gives-400-million-to-harvard-for-engineering-school.html', 'snippet': 'The gift