d hoped to redeem a series of bonds early in a move that it said would save it more than $300 million a year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — A British court ruled on Wednesday that the Lloyds Banking Group would not be allowed to redeem a series of high-interest bonds, a move the lender hoped would save it more than $300 million a year.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Court Rules Against Lloyds Banking Group on Bond Redemption', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lloyds Loses in Court', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bray, Chad', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lloyds Banking Group Plc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Prudential Regulation Authority (Great Britain)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-03T14:37:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chad Bray', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bray', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a9140200-1f79-569e-a80b-bd9efdbee815', 'word_count': 416, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a9140200-1f79-569e-a80b-bd9efdbee815'}, {'abstract': 'A look at the N.B.A. finals matchup through the lens of Dean Oliver’s “four factors”: making field goals, making free throws, rebounding and avoiding turnovers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/04/sports/basketball/nba-finals-four-factors-illuminat