 1203, 'uri': 'nyt://article/810bc224-19fc-5f5c-a831-25b64b6f21d8'}, {'abstract': 'Former Gov. Mike Huckabee of Arkansas had 70 minutes of airtime on Fox News in May, followed by Senator Rand Paul of Kentucky (53 minutes), who led all candidates with 12 appearances on the network.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/06/03/mike-huckabee-and-rand-paul-have-most-airtime-on-fox-news-data-show/', 'snippet': 'Former Gov. Mike Huckabee of Arkansas had 70 minutes of airtime on Fox News in May, followed by Senator Rand Paul of Kentucky (53 minutes), who led all candidates with 12 appearances on the network.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The first Republican presidential debate is less than 60 days away, and not all the Republican candidates seeking the presidency will make the stage. One of the co-hosts of the debate, Fox News, has said only candidates who reach the top 10 in polling will be invited to attend.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/us/politics/03firstdraft-rand-paul-fox/03firstdraft-rand-paul-fox-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/03/us/politics/03firstdraft-rand-paul-fox/03firstdraft-rand-paul-fox-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/us/politics/03firstdraft-rand-paul-fox/03firstdraft-rand-paul-fox-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/us/politics/03firstdraft-rand-paul-fox/03firstdraft-rand-paul-fox-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 