ties into everything from craft breweries to a contemporary art museum. So now Savannah’s antebellum beauty of live oaks and elegant squares coexists with cool shops and innovative restaurants. Welcome to the new South.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '36 Hours in Savannah, Ga.', 'kicker': 'Weekend Guide', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '36 Hours in Savannah, Ga.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Ingrid K', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Savannah (Ga)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Georgia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-03T17:55:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ingrid K. Williams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ingrid', 'middlename': 'K.', 'lastname': 'Williams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c6b7d07a-ed9e-51a1-839c-b6e4ba4536d3', 'word_count': 1526, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c6b7d07a-ed9e-51a1-839c-b6e4ba4536d3'}, {'abstract': 'The service will include unlimited on-demand access to the channel’s original series as well as hundreds of hours of movies and sports programming.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/04/business/media/showtime-to-introduce-streaming-service-in-july.html', 'snippet': 'The service will include unlimited on-demand access to the channel’s original series as well as hundreds of hours of movies and sports programming.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Following in the footsteps of its rival HBO, the premium cable network Showtime announced on Wednesday that its new Internet streaming service will make its debut in early July on Apple devices fo