://article/480127bf-4405-5f82-8ca9-c50a75676d6d'}, {'abstract': 'Take all the photos you want, back them up automatically into the cloud and use Google’s image search abilities to find them later.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/04/technology/personaltech/upload-the-pictures-and-let-google-photos-do-the-rest.html', 'snippet': 'Take all the photos you want, back them up automatically into the cloud and use Google’s image search abilities to find them later.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I DON’T take a lot of photographs. I have a pretty decent camera with me at all times — my iPhone 5s — but organizing hundreds or thousands of photos has never seemed worth the effort.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/business/04gadgetwise-web2/04gadgetwise-web2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1065, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/03/business/04gadgetwise-web2/04gadgetwise-web2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1065}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/business/04gadgetwise-web2/04gadgetwise-web2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 577, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/business/04gadgetwise-web2/04gadgetwise-web2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1136, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/business/04gadgetwise-web2/04gadgetwise-web2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/03/business/04gadgetwise-web2/04gadgetwise-web2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/business/04gadgetwise-web2/04gadgetwise-web2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Upload the Pictures, and Let Google Photos Do the Rest', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Upload the Pictures, and Let Google Photos Do the Rest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cameras', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-03T19:28:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By E. Justin Swanson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'E.', 'middlename': 'Justin', 'lastname': 'Swanson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/682274c6-72e2-5020-87ce-79f34085acbc', 'word_count': 894, 'uri': 'nyt://article/682274c6-72e2-5020-87ce-79f34085acbc'}, {'abstract': 'Times critics share what they’ve been listening to lately.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/03/classical-playlist-brahms-arvo-prt-and-gorczycki/', 'snippet': 'Times critics share what they’ve been listening to lately.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRAHMS: Symphony No. 4 Claudio Abbado, conductor; Berlin Philharmonic(Deutsche Grammophon)Carlos Kleiber’s Brahms Fourth with the Vienna Philharmonic is supposed to be in a league of its own. Truthfully, though, I turn more often to Claudio Abbado’s recording with the Berlin Philharmonic, as I did again last week to prepare for Manfred Honeck’s superb appearance with the New York Philharmonic. Not everything Abbado recorded remains worthwhile listening, but his marriage of the cavernous Karajan sound with Italianate lyricism worked wonders in the Brahms he released in the early 1990s. (David Allen)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/theater/03gosling/03gosling-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/03/theater/03gosling/03gosling-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/theater/03gosling/03gosling-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/theater/03gosling/03gosling-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/theater/03gosling/03gosling-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/03/theater/03gosling/03gosling-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/theater/03gosling/03gosling-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Classical Playlist: Brahms, Arvo Pärt and Gorczycki', 'kicker':