s in the 11th Arrondissement.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Nutella is my drug,” says the chef Simone Tondo, while lighting a cigarette and sipping a café on the terrace of Le Square Trousseau in Paris. The Sardinian-born chef of the restaurant Roseval may know a thing or two about mackerel and heirloom tomatoes, but it’s hazelnut spread that really gets him going — that and the on-demand car service Uber. “It’s my new friend,” he says.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/t-magazine/03tondo-lieberman-2/03tondo-lieberman-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/03/t-magazine/03tondo-lieberman-2/03tondo-lieberman-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/t-magazine/03tondo-lieberman-2/03tondo-lieberman-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/t-magazine/03tondo-lieberman-2/03tondo-lieberman-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/t-magazine/03tondo-lieberman-2/03tondo-lieberman-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/03/t-magazine/03tondo-lieberman-2/03tondo-lieberman-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/t-magazine/03tondo-lieberman-2/0