ncent, trying new things is all part of the journey, come failure or come success.', 'lead_paragraph': 'St. Vincent (nee Annie Clark), 32, has been performing under that name since 2006. In February, she won her first Grammy, for Best Alternative Album, for her self-titled album. When she’s not on tour, the singer, who grew up in Dallas, lives in the East Village in Manhattan, which will be her home base when she performs at the Governors Ball Music Festival on Friday and at Barclays Center for the “Contemporary Color” concert June 27 and 28. Here, she discusses her beauty regimen. BEE SHAPIRO', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/04/fashion/04SKIN1/04SKIN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/04/fashion/04SKIN1/04SKIN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/04/fashion/04SKIN1/04SKIN1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/04/fashion/04SKIN1/04SKIN1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/04/fashion/04SKIN1/04SKIN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/04/fashion/04SKIN1/04SKIN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'ima