rown races since 2011.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/04/sports/long-path-to-the-top-of-racing-for-larry-collmus-the-voice-of-the-triple-crown.html', 'snippet': 'Collmus, the successor of the renowned Tom Durkin, began calling races at age 18 and has called the Triple Crown races since 2011.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Larry Collmus was practicing his equine scales in the race announcer’s booth at Belmont Park. “Regia Marina, Clearly Cheating — that’s a nice name — Tiger Moth,” he said, speaking to himself, memorizing the six new names before doing it again. “Clearly Cheating. Regia Marina, Fast Retailing.” His pace picked up. “Il Mulino, Majestic Empire, Tiger Moth.” ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/04/sports/Y-RACECALLER/Y-RACECALLER-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/04/sports/Y-RACECALLER/Y-RACECALLER-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/04/sports/Y-RACECALLER/Y-RACECALLER-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/04/sports/Y-RACECALLER/Y-RACECALLER-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/04/sports/Y-RACECALLER/Y-RACECALLER-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/04/sports/Y-RACECALLER/Y-RACECALLER-thumbStand