Robin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pogrebin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aa007a26-9e35-51c0-bd1c-338392bb22c8', 'word_count': 836, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa007a26-9e35-51c0-bd1c-338392bb22c8'}, {'abstract': 'The president of the Boston Public Library resigned Wednesday amid a federal investigation into the disappearance of two artworks reported to be worth more than $600,000 from the library’s collection.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/04/us/massachusetts-president-quits-boston-library-as-art-goes-missing.html', 'snippet': 'The president of the Boston Public Library resigned Wednesday amid a federal investigation into the disappearance of two artworks reported to be worth more than $600,000 from the library’s collection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The president of the Boston Public Library resigned Wednesday amid a federal investigation into the disappearance of two artworks from the library’s collection. Amy Ryan, who became the president of the library system in 2008, stepped down hours after announcing new security measures for the system’s holdings. The two works, a 1634 Rembrandt etching valued at $20,000 to $30,000 and a 1504 Albrecht Durer engraving valued at $600,000, were discovered missing in April. Officials said the Rembrandt was believed to have been gone for more than a year. It was unclear whether the pieces were stolen or misfiled. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Massachusetts: President Quits Boston Library as Art Goes Missing ', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | New England', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Massachusetts: President Quits Boston Library as Art Goes Missing ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston Public Library', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, 