 Dish and T-Mobile Said to Be Discussing Merger', 'kicker': 'News', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hedge Funds', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Private Equity', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shareholder Rights and Activism', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Venture Capital', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davis, Lanny J', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Draghi, Mario', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hollande, Francois', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Merkel, Angela', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tsipras, Alexis', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'DISH Network Corporation', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Central Bank', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Commission', 'rank': 16, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goldman Sachs Group Inc', 'rank': 17, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 18, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Samsung Group', 'rank': 19, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'T-Mobile US Inc', 'rank': 20, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-04T11:31:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dealbook', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dealbook', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0829abe7-6d0c-52b9-812c-54c2bc8a45b8', 'word_count': 1755, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0829abe7-6d0c-52b9-812c-54c2bc8a45b8'}, {'abstract': 'Fluctuations in Chinese stocks, concerns about the Greek debt crisis and a rout in European bonds contributed to shares’ fickle movements.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/05/business/global-stock-market-activity.html', 'snippet': 'Fluctuations in Chinese stocks, concerns about the Greek debt crisis and a rout in European bonds contributed to shares’ fickle movements.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Volatility weighed on global stock markets on Thursday as a roller coaster trading day in China added to the grinding uncertainty about the debt crisis in Greece. A rout in European bonds continued.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Global Stock Markets React to Uncertainty in Asia and Europe', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Standard & Poor's 500-Stock Index", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Central Bank', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Eurozone', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Draghi, Mario', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-04T11:58:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Jolly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jolly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ebcc7604-e57e-5377-a201-376338d47dd6', 'word_count': 636, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ebcc7604-e57e-5377-a201-376338d47dd6'}, {'abstract': 'After centuries of appropriation of the French warrior for political ends, Arthur Honegger’s 1938 oratorio depicts Joan as a naïve teenager.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/07/arts/music/joan-of-arc-at-the-stake-distilled-to-her-essence-at-the-new-york-philharmonic.html', 'snippet': 'After centuries of appropriation of the French warrior for political ends, Arthur Honegger’s 1938 oratorio depicts Joan as a naïve teenager.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the Metropolitan Museum of Art hangs a large, mesmerizing painting of Joan of Arc by the 19th-century French painter Jules Bastien-Lepage. Joan’s gaze is both innocent and determined, her blue eyes focused on something that seems to hold her in thrall. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/arts/07JOAN5/07JOAN5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1050, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/07/arts/07JOAN5/07JOAN5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1050}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/arts/07JOAN5/07JOAN5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 586, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/arts/07JOAN5/07JOAN5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1171, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/arts/07JOAN5/07JOAN5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/07/arts/07JOAN5/07JOAN5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/arts/07JOAN5/07JOAN5-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Joan of Arc at the Stake,’ Distilled to Her Essence at the New York Philharmonic', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A &#8216;Joan&#8217; Distilled to Her Na&iuml;ve Essence', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schweitzer, Vivien', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cotillard, Marion', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gilbert, Alan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Honegger, Arthur', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Masur, Kurt', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Philharmonic', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-04T12:00:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vivien Schweitzer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vivien', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schweitzer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cad63e90-a10b-5fd8-a564-f60890b76e4a', 'word_count': 1246, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cad63e90-a10b-5fd8-a564-f60890b76e4a'}, {'abstract': 'Heading off the grid for a few days to talk and listen at IRE conference.', 'web_url': 'https://publiceditor.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/04/a-short-but-heartfelt-blast-of-optimism-about-democracy-and-the-press/', 'snippet': 'Heading off the grid for a few days to talk and listen at IRE conference.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There aren’t many days when I feel optimistic about American democracy and how the press is functioning in its role of watchdog and keeping citizens informed. But Wednesday was one of them.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Short Blast of Optimism About Democracy and The Press', 'kicker': 'The Public Editor&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-06-04T12:00:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margaret Sullivan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Margaret', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sullivan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4ed38d36-ddfc-5f56-b709-0531fd6f3fd0', 'word_count': 336, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4ed38d36-ddfc-5f56-b709-0531fd6f3fd0'}, {'abstract': 'An ice-cream-cone-size donation to a charity I disagree with isn’t much — but it’s too much.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/04/speaking-out-against-autism-speaks-even-if-it-means-no-ice-cream/', 'snippet': 'An ice-cream-cone-size donation to a charity I disagree with isn’t much — but it’s too much.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last month, my 5-year-old daughter told me that her after-school program was raising money for Autism Speaks. She was excited because (as explained via emails and fliers from the school), the fund-raiser would take place at a local ice cream store and all her friends would be there. The money would go to support a particularly beloved teacher running the New York marathon on behalf of the charity. My daughter, very excited, asked if we could go.', 'source': '