son', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6d708171-dd4c-5439-81ce-ffb51230165a', 'word_count': 1, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6d708171-dd4c-5439-81ce-ffb51230165a'}, {'abstract': 'What did you think of this feature? We began it last July and have covered everything from shark attacks and Disneyland to the Scopes Trial and the Space race — all with the goal of showing students how easy and fun it can be to use the Times archives to investigate American history and culture.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/04/throwback-thursday-on-summer-hiatus/', 'snippet': 'What did you think of this feature? We began it last July and have covered everything from shark attacks and Disneyland to the Scopes Trial and the Space race — all with the goal of showing students how easy and fun it can be to use the Times arch...', 'lead_paragraph': 'We began this feature last July, with a post about Disneyland, and followed it with entries on topics from the Scopes trial to the space race, shark attacks, “Star Wars,” teenage slang and the Simpsons. Along the way, we hope we showed students how easy and fun it can be to use the New York Times archives to investigate American history and culture. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/learning/SummerVacation1953LN/SummerVacation1953LN-articleLarge.png', 'height': 456, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/03/learning/SummerVacation1953LN/SummerVacation1953LN-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 456}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/03/learning/SummerVacation1953LN/SummerVacation1953LN-jumbo.png', 'height': 777, 'width': 1024, 'subType