nd political dynasties as well.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/06/04/ad-backing-martin-omalley-jabs-at-hillary-clinton-and-jeb-bush/', 'snippet': 'Former Gov. Martin O’Malley has focused his campaign message on the anti-Wall Street sentiment popular among the Democratic left. An ad supporting him frames the critique around political dynasties as well.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A new TV ad from the “super PAC” supporting former Gov. Martin O’Malley of Maryland is titled “Wall Street’s Public Enemy No. 1.” But it seems the intended target of the ad is Hillary Rodham Clinton and Jeb Bush.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ad Backing Martin O’Malley Jabs at Hillary Clinton and Jeb Bush', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Action Committees', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Advertising', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bush, Jeb', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Malley, Martin J", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-04T18:01:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Corasaniti', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Corasaniti', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e75c4ca6-b64e-505d-8f26-8d3b7bbfc141', 'word_count': 212, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e75c4ca6-b64e-505d-8f26-8d3b7bbfc141'}, {'abstract': '