et Sounds” in the studio. And a parallel narrative follows the musician two decades later (and played by John Cusack), struggling to repair his life and meeting Melinda Ledbetter, the woman he would fall for.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Love & Mercy’ (With Movie Trailer): Bill Pohlad Narrates a Scene', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pohlad, William M (1955- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Brian (1942- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dano, Paul', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cusack, John', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Love & Mercy (Movie)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-04T19:53:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/176f6cbd-953c-571b-b355-bfc1bdde9ee9', 'word_count': 617, 'uri': 'nyt://article/176f6cbd-953c-571b-b355-bfc1bdde9ee9'}, {'abstract': 'The food gurus seem oddly irrelevant to those in treatment for cancer.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/04/living-with-cancer-keep-on-cooking/', 'snippet': 'The food gurus seem oddly irrelevant to those in treatment for cancer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Julia put a glass jar of turkey-tail mushrooms on the restaurant table. Drinking home-brewed tea helps her combat the side effects of treatment. The day before a blood test — which would reveal whether or not an experimental drug was working — I placed one delicate bit on the center of my palm. The ridged striations and concentric ruffles reminded me of the tiny angel-wing shells that Leslie’s partner had collected on Sanibel Island for our cancer support group. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/05/science/05gubar/05gubar-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 430, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/05/science/05gubar/05gubar-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 430}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/05/science/05gubar/05gubar-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 734, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/05/science/05gubar/05gubar-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1393, 'width': 1944, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/05/science/05gubar/05gubar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/05/science/05gubar/05gubar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/05/science/05gubar/05gubar-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Living With Cancer: Keep On Cooking', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cancer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mushrooms', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-04T19:56:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susan Gubar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gubar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ed13d007-1ea2-5bd0-abe6-b18831275502', 'word_count': 1097, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ed13d007-1ea2-5bd0-abe6-b18831275502'}, {'abstract': 'A look at preparations onstage and off for Sunday’s Broadway awards celebration.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2015/06/04/nytnow/04nytnow-tonys.html', 'snippet': 'A look at preparations onstage and off for Sunday’s Broadway awards celebration.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A look at preparations onstage and off for Sunday’s Broadway awards celebration.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/04/nytnow/04nytnow-tonys-slide-JYCN/04nytnow-tonys-slide-JYCN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/04/nytnow/04nytnow-tonys-slide-JYCN/04nytnow-tonys-slide-JYCN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/04/nytnow/04nytnow-tonys-slide-JYCN/04nytnow-tonys-slide-JYCN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/04/nytnow/04nytnow-tonys-slide-