 an influential exhibition called “Out of India: Contemporary Art of the South Asian Diaspora” at the Queens Museum.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Indian Artists Look Westward, and Homeward, at the Queens Museum', 'kicker': 'Art Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Indian Artists Look Westward and Homeward', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cotter, Holland', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Culture (Arts)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Queens Museum', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-04T20:08:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Holland Cotter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Holland', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cotter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/08608e10-e2d8-54dc-8dc2-0c44898d3a1f', 'word_count': 1288, 'uri': 'nyt://article/08608e10-e2d8-54dc-8dc2-0c44898d3a1f'}, {'abstract': 'Some large galleries have said that they would participate in a new art fair this summer.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/04/inaugural-seattle-art-fair-announces-lineup-of-galleries/', 'snippet': 'Some large galleries have said that they would participate in a new art fair this summer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'First-time art fairs often struggle for recognition, for an audience and for participation by the kinds of galleries that might actually draw collectors and a crowd. But the new Seattle Art Fair, to take place a