nd the filmmaker Paolo Sorrentino —\xa0were honored by the American Academy in Rome.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last night, the American Academy in Rome honored Carlo Petrini, the founder of the Slow Food Movement, and the filmmaker Paolo Sorrentino at a dinner chaired by Ginevra Elkann. The McKim Medal Laureates were feted (by the likes of chef Alice Waters and T’s editor in chief, Deborah Needleman) under twinkling Italian stars at the Villa Aurelia, a 17th-century wonder surrounded by acres of gardens, for their contributions to the arts and humanities — and received medals designed by Cy Twombly. The photographer Gianni Cipriano captured the evening for T.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Starlit Dinner in Rome', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Petrini, Carlo', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sorrentino, Paolo', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Waters, Alice', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN ACADEMY IN ROME', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rome (Italy)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-04T20:50:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0aa1fc62-10f8-56da-8db6-66e7b0807d9e', 'word_count': 90, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0aa1fc62-10f8-56da-8db6-66e7b0807d9e'}, {'abstract': 'Looks from the collection.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2015/06/04/fashion/20150604GUCCI.html', 'sni