stic man-on-horse-under-the-Southwestern-sky cinematography, and in its best scene, Scott’s three grown sons get drunk in a roughneck bar and stumble into a brawl with some cowboys. But such moments are too scattered to make this jumble of a film come together. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘Wild Horses,’ a Film by and Starring Robert Duvall', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Reckoning on the Ranch ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Duvall, Robert', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Franco, James', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hartnett, Josh', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Wild Horses (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-04T22:18:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/9c5c01f5-c548-5b85-8eaf-dc399bcdb8ef', 'word_count': 379, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9c5c01f5-c548-5b85-8eaf-dc399bcdb8ef'}, {'abstract': 'The last port of call for the hundreds presumed dead after their ship capsized was Chibi, a small town known as the site of a pivotal battle in the ancient legend of the Three Kingdoms.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/05/world/asia/12-hours-before-yangtze-disaster-tourists-enjoyed-a-morning-on-land.html', 'snippet': 'The last port of call for the hundreds presumed dead after their ship capsized was Chibi, a small town known as the site of a pivotal battle in the ancient legend of the Three Kingdoms.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHIBI, China — The tourist park here beside the Yangtze River was bustling on Monday with cruise ship passengers on a port of call. They strolled through the lush grounds, laughing and taking pictures. Some sat next to a lake and a line of toy cannons pointed over the water.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '12 Hours Before Yangtze Disaster, Tourists Enjoyed a Morning on Land', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Maritime Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yangtze River (China)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chongqing Oriental Ferry Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chibi (China)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cruises', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-04T22:19:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Wong', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wong', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8fb5fbc4-ae34-55a6-8080-c24e3014145f', 'word_count': 716, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8fb5fbc4-ae34-55a6-8080-c24e3014145f'}, {'abstract': 'We’re trying something new: a quick rundown of the day’s top stories.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/04/nytnow/your-thursday-evening-briefing.html', 'snippet': 'We’re trying something new: a quick rundown of the day’s top stories.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We’re trying something new: a quick nightly rundown of the day’s top stories. What do you think? Let us know at briefing@nytimes.com.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype':