ropean countries do their fair share in handling the huge number of people seeking asylum.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/06/opinion/europes-shared-responsibility-for-migrants.html', 'snippet': 'A proposed system of quotas would ensure that European countries do their fair share in handling the huge number of people seeking asylum.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The European Commission’s proposal last week of a system of quotas to distribute migrants among the European Union’s 28 member states is a welcome step toward a permanent, more equitable process for dealing with the waves of migrants seeking safety and opportunity in Europe.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Europe’s Shared Responsibility for Migrants', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Shared Responsibility for Migrants', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Asylum, Right of', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-05T11:59:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/916f0183-6657-5937-9ca8-bc484a25c865', 'word_count': 411, 'uri': 'nyt://article/916f0183-6657-5937-9ca8-bc484a25c865'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Andrews had never written a script before as he set out to adapt his novel for the screen.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/07/movies/jesse-andrews-learns-on-the-fly-to-write-me-and-earl-and-the-dying-girl.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Andrews had never written a script before as he set out to adapt his novel for the screen.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When he set out to be a filmmaker, Jesse Andrews had to be convinced that spending $200 on screenplay-writing software was a good investment. He admits he didn’t know the first thing about writing a script. On the other hand, he was already the author of a best-selling novel, had drawn the attention of A-team Hollywood and had a production company waiting to film the movie adaptation he was just sitting down to write.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/arts/07EARL1/07EARL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/07/arts/07EARL1/07EARL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/arts/07EARL1/07EARL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/arts/07EARL1/07EARL1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/arts/07EARL1/07EARL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/07/arts/07EARL1/07EARL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/arts/07EARL1/07EARL1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jesse Andrews Learns on the Fly to Write ‘Me and Earl and the Dying Girl’', 'kicker': None, 'content