f93a3409-cc73-562d-9478-782693f906f5'}, {'abstract': 'Our monthly collection for May also features teenage winners of essay contests sponsored by the Opinion, Business and Style sections.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/05/teenagers-in-the-times-may-2015/', 'snippet': 'Our monthly collection for May also features teenage winners of essay contests sponsored by the Opinion, Business and Style sections.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As regular readers know, this monthly feature is a roundup of recent articles about young people that have appeared in The Times. This month, however, writing by teenagers popped all over the paper. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/05/27/science/27anxiety-LN/27anxiety-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/05/27/science/27anxiety-LN/27anxiety-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/05/27/science/27anxiety-LN/27anxiety-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/05/27/science/27anxiety-LN/27anxiety-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/05/27/science/27anxiety-LN/27anxiety-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/05/27/science/27anxiety-LN/27anxiety-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'capt