olitan Playhouse Tackles Labor History in ‘Injunction Granted’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Surveying the Wages of Labor War', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Theater Project', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Playhouse', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Injunction Granted (Play)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-05T20:24:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexis Soloski', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Soloski', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/0dc189e8-4eee-562e-8d4f-15eb133b4074', 'word_count': 420, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0dc189e8-4eee-562e-8d4f-15eb133b4074'}, {'abstract': 'A Czech series has, not surprisingly, stirred intense reactions about mixing such a dark period in history into an entertainment format more often associated with the Kardashians.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/06/world/europe/czech-reality-tv-show-makes-a-game-of-life-under-nazi-rule.html', 'snippet': 'A Czech series has, not surprisingly, stirred intense reactions about mixing such a dark period in history into an entertainment format more often associated with the Kardashians.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PRAGUE — We have seen toddlers in tiaras, been left “Naked and Afraid” and met more real housewives than a postman.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Grim Reality: Czech TV Makes Game of Nazi Era', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Grim Reality: Czech TV Makes Game of Nazi Era ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lyman, Rick', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Czech Republic', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Holocaust and the Nazi Era', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Public Broadcasting', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reality Television', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Holiday in the Protectorate (TV Program)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-05T20:32:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Lyman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lyman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b305495e-72d6-557f-9afb-12f627822c39', 'word_count': 1302, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b305495e-72d6-557f-9afb-12f627822c39'}, {'abstract': 'Outreach efforts by the police and victims’ services groups have helped more survivors report sexual assaults and rapes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/07/nyregion/in-grim-rape-statistics-signs-of-progress.html', 'snippet': 'Outreach efforts by the police and victims’ services groups have helped more survivors report sexual assaults and rapes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last week, as Mayor Bill de Blasio worked to quell anxieties over rising instances of violence in the city, a young woman in Lower Manhattan found herself victim of the kind of terrifying crime that now seems almost to belong to another era in New York. Early on Monday in Chinatown, the police said, three teenage boys attacked a woman they had just met at an Internet cafe. Investigators said two raped and robbed her before the group headed to her apartment with the keys they had stolen from her. Video from surveillance cameras at the cafe and at a deli where she later sought help, which ultimately led to arrests, showed her battered and bloodied.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07BIGSUB/07BIGSUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07BIGSUB/07BIGSUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07BIGSUB/07BIGSUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 686, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07BIGSUB/07BIGSUB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1372, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07BIGSUB/07BIGSUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07BIGSUB/07BIGSUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07BIGSUB/07BIGSUB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Grim Rape Statistics, Signs of Progress', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Grim Statistics, Signs of Progress', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name'