{'abstract': 'The stay-at-home father and part-time artist is no longer quite as rare a sighting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/07/fashion/these-dads-are-writing-their-own-tickets.html', 'snippet': 'The stay-at-home father and part-time artist is no longer quite as rare a sighting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1988, Ben Fountain, then a 30-year-old lawyer in North Dallas, decided to quit his practice to stay at home with his child and learn how to write fiction. His wife, also a lawyer, made enough money to support the family and hire a nanny. Mr. Fountain used the six hours a day she was on call to write before picking up the caregiving slack and household maintenance in the afternoon.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/fashion/7FUTURETENSE/7FUTURETENSE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 498, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/07/fashion/7FUTURETENSE/7FUTURETENSE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 498}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/fashion/7FUTURETENSE/7FUTURETENSE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 850, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/fashion/7FUTURETENSE/7FUTURETENSE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1307, 'width': 1574, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/fashion/7FUTURETENSE/7FUTURETENSE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/07/fashion/7FUTURETENSE/7FUTURETENS