 social network called This. allows users to share exactly one article a day from mainstream outlets and more obscure sites, as well as Tumblr posts, videos and even podcasts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/07/nyregion/an-app-that-lets-you-find-and-share-articles.html', 'snippet': 'A new social network called This. allows users to share exactly one article a day from mainstream outlets and more obscure sites, as well as Tumblr posts, videos and even podcasts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When you scroll through your Facebook feed, there are particular kinds of posts that you’re looking for, even if you don’t realize it. It could be that you favor items like your cousin Carly’s wedding pictures, an update on Nathan’s trip to Thailand or the interesting articles that you know your friend Anna is liable to share.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07APP-CITY/07APP-CITY-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07APP-CITY/07APP-CITY-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07APP-CITY/07APP-CITY-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1023, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07APP-CITY/07APP-CITY-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1409, 'width': 1410, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07APP-CITY/07APP-CITY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTy