 Netherlands in Amsterdam.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the United States national team, the past year has been marred by a sudden sting of defensive collapses. In Friday night’s exhibition in Amsterdam, the team turned the tables for a change. With three goals in the final 20 minutes, including one in the 88th minute and a 90th-minute winner, the Americans erased a two-goal deficit and stunned the Netherlands, 4-3, in a friendly in Amsterdam.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Player Ratings: Netherlands (3) vs. United States (4)', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sports Briefing | Soccer; U.S. Edges Netherlands', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "United States Men's National Soccer Team", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brooks, John A', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klinsmann, Jurgen', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-05T23:35:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Sciaretta', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sciaretta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bf1f363c-b769-5422-b1d3-2aae009332a7', 'word_count': 936, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bf1f363c-b769-5422-b1d3-2aae009332a7'}, {'abstract': 'The popularity of the powerful drug, associated with sex parties, has spread from affluent gay white men to black and Hispanic gay men.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/07/nyregion/meth-finds-a-new-market-in-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'The popularity of the powerful drug, associated with sex parties, has spread from affluent gay white men to black and Hispanic gay men.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The waiting room of Gay Men of African Descent, a service agency near Downtown Brooklyn, is almost always quiet and empty. Artful photographs of naked men under tinted lights hang on the walls without an audience. Magazines for people who are H.I.V. positive sit untouched in a swirl on a carved African pedestal. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07METH-promo/07METH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07METH-promo/07METH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07METH-promo/07METH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07METH-promo/07METH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07METH-promo/07METH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07METH-promo/07METH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07METH-promo/07METH-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Meth Finds a New Market in New York', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Meth Takes a New Turn in the City', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Methamphetamines', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Secret, Mosi', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality and Bisexuality', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hispanic-Americans', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-05T23:40:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mosi Secret', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mosi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Secret', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/066cfd50-0a25-58ed-89fc-bb406ae5bd65', 'word_count': 1431, 'uri': 'nyt://article/066cfd50-0a25-58ed-89fc-bb406ae5bd65'}, {'abstract': 'Even those who are skeptical of scams may be surprised by the eye-popping payouts one Brooklyn man made to a Times Square psychic in hopes of being united with the woman he loved.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/06/nyregion/he-went-to-the-fortuneteller-now-his-fortune-is-gone.html', 'snippet': 'Even those who are skeptical of scams may be surprised by the eye-popping payouts one Brooklyn man made to a Times Square psychic in hopes of being united with the woman he loved.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Everyone knows that when a man loves a woman, he can’t keep his mind on nothing else. He’ll spend his very last dime. Give up all his comfort, sleep out in the rain.', 'print_