health-care-expansion-is-rejected-in-florida.html', 'snippet': 'It was the third time that legislators had considered and spurned some version of health care expansion since passage of the Affordable Care Act.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — In another rebuke of the Obama administration’s efforts to expand health care to the uninsured, Florida’s Republican-led House of Representatives soundly rejected a plan on Friday that state officials said would have covered as many as 650,000 residents.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Health Care Expansion Is Rejected in Florida', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Health Care Expansion Is Rejected in Florida', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Madigan, Nick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scott, Richard L', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicaid', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-06T00:50:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Madigan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Madigan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/631595a9-a7dc-5c25-a09a-1b81745eb578', 'word_count': 701, 'uri': 'nyt://article/631595a9-a7dc-5c25-a09a-1b81745eb578'}, {'abstract': 'A look at some of the numbers in Williams’s remarkable 18-year career at Grand Slam events.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/06/sports/tennis/serena-williams