 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/3861f9e7-ab9e-5a64-b54a-dc0937bea9d6', 'word_count': 31, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3861f9e7-ab9e-5a64-b54a-dc0937bea9d6'}, {'abstract': 'The musical, directed by Don Stephenson, resurrects the mobsters, hustlers and dames who inhabited Times Square.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/07/nyregion/review-guys-and-dolls-in-east-haddam-revives-the-world-and-patois-of-damon-runyons-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'The musical, directed by Don Stephenson, resurrects the mobsters, hustlers and dames who inhabited Times Square.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What’s playing at the Goodspeed? I’ll tell you what’s playing at the Goodspeed. Story of a high-rolling gambler who wins way more than he bargained for when a mission doll upsets his game. Yes, Sky Masterson and Sarah Brown are back, along with their pals Nathan Detroit, Miss Adelaide (don’t call her Ms.!) and the whole gang of charming lowlifes who inhabit the Broadway of “Guys and Dolls.”', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07ARTSCT2/07ARTSCT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07ARTSCT2/07ARTSCT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07ARTSCT2/07ARTSCT2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 671, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/nyregion/07ARTSCT2/07ARTSCT2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1341, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbn