 Republican candidates descended on Iowa for Senator Joni Ernst’s “Roast and Ride,” an event that was heavy on the hogs (both the bikes and the pork) and that offered the candidates a chance to make their pitch to primary voters.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/06/06/presidential-hopefuls-descend-on-iowa-courting-favor-with-joni-ernst/', 'snippet': 'Seven 2016 Republican candidates descended on Iowa for Senator Joni Ernst’s “Roast and Ride,” an event that was heavy on the hogs (both the bikes and the pork) and that offered the candidates a chance to make their pitch to primary voters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DES MOINES — Arriving at the kickoff of her inaugural “Roast and Ride” event here, fresh off a two-hour ride up from Red Oak on her 2009 Soft Tail Deluxe Harley-Davidson Saturday morning, Senator Joni Ernst of Iowa grinned as a friend pressed a Monster Energy drink into her hand.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/us/07iowa-web-2/07iowa-web-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/07/us/07iowa-web-2/07iowa-web-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/us/07iowa-web-2/07iowa-web-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/us/07iowa-web-2/07iowa-web-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/us/07iowa-web-2/07iowa-web-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'hei