go to great lengths to avoid being blamed for failing to protect poor and uninsured citizens.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/08/opinion/floridas-foolish-medicaid-lawsuit.html', 'snippet': 'Some Republican leaders are ready to go to great lengths to avoid being blamed for failing to protect poor and uninsured citizens.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Florida’s governor, Rick Scott, got a well-deserved brushoff from federal health officials in  May after he accused the government of trying to coerce his state into expanding its Medicaid program, even though the Supreme Court has ruled that such expansion is purely voluntary.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/06/opinion/08mon3web/08mon3web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 386, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/06/opinion/08mon3web/08mon3web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 386}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/06/opinion/08mon3web/08mon3web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 659, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/06/opinion/08mon3web/08mon3web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1319, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/06/opinion/08mon3web/08mon3web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/06/opinion/08mon3web/08mon3web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'c