0baa80'}, {'abstract': 'After escorting American Pharoah on a whirlwind journey that ended with a Triple Crown, Bob Baffert’s assistants Jimmy and Dana Barnes are perhaps closest to the colt.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/09/sports/longtime-assistant-trainers-savor-the-ride-with-american-pharoah.html', 'snippet': 'After escorting American Pharoah on a whirlwind journey that ended with a Triple Crown, Bob Baffert’s assistants Jimmy and Dana Barnes are perhaps closest to the colt.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The assistant trainer Jimmy Barnes watched the race that changed everything from behind the winner’s circle. He was calm and introspective, thinking about his father, Laverne, who had died 15 years earlier, almost to the day. He watched his family, including his wife, Dana, who works alongside him in Bob Baffert’s barn, cheer and cry and cheer some more.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/09/sports/09RACINGweb3/09RACINGweb3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/09/sports/09RACINGweb3/09RACINGweb3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/09/sports/09RACINGweb3/09RACINGweb3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/09/sports/09RACINGweb3/09RACINGweb3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/09/sports/09RACINGweb3/09RACINGweb3-thumbStanda