iew-governors-ball-is-ruled-by-women.html', 'snippet': 'Women had the larger ideas and more ambitious sets at this festival, with acts like Lana Del Ray, Björk and Florence and the Machine offering the strongest, strangest music.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Women brought the strongest and strangest music to the fifth annual Governors Ball festival, held Friday through Sunday on Randalls Island. They were worldly and otherworldly, heroic and vulnerable, proudly pop-savvy or defining their own kinds of fringe. Of course, they were outnumbered by men, who held most of the headlining slots.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Governors Ball Is Ruled by Women', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Outnumbered, the Women Reign at Governors Ball', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Governors Ball Music Festival', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Randalls Island (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bjork', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Drake (Rapper)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Del Rey, Lana', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Deadmau5', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Welch, Florence', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yankovic, Weird Al', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Simpson, Sturgill', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'St Vincent (1982- )', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ADAMS, RYAN', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'My Morning Jacket (Music Group)', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Black Keys (Music Group)', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_