 a drug-resistant form of the disease.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/09/science/tuberculosis-case-prompts-search-for-patients-fellow-airline-passengers.html', 'snippet': '\u200b The risk to the public is low, the C.D.C. said Monday, although the patient, who traveled from India in April, has been hospitalized in Maryland with a drug-resistant form of the disease.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Health officials are trying to identify people who may have come into contact with a woman who flew from India to Chicago in April and had a type of tuberculosis that is highly resistant to drug treatment.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tuberculosis Case Prompts Search for Patient’s Fellow Airline Passengers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Officials Trace Path of Passenger With TB', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grady, Denise', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tuberculosis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Centers for Disease Control and Prevention', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Epidemics', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Institutes of Health', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-09T00:49:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Denise Grady', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Denise', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grady', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dde6bfd6-67