ian’s brother, Ali Rezaian, said the Iranian defense lawyer for Mr. Rezaian, Leila Ahsan, was filing a complaint against the Mehr News Agency, a semiofficial news service in Iran that had reported what it said were details from the first hearing on May 26, in violation of a court-ordered ban. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Iran: Hearing Is Held in Reporter’s Trial', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Middle East; Iran: Hearing Is Held in Reporter’s Trial', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rezaian, Jason', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Washington Post', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Prisoners', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of the Press', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-09T01:46:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/33caffa6-17ef-5d5b-b86c-d32a87d5d18c', 'word_count': 166, 'uri': 'nyt://article/33caffa6-17ef-5d5b-b86c-d32a87d5d18c'}, {'abstract': 'Prosecutors say the men charged in the 2013 stunt endangered the public; defense lawyers say their clients are skydiving experts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/09/nyregion/world-trade-center-parachutists-go-on-trial.html', 'snippet': 'Prosecutors say the men charged in the 2013 stunt endangered the public; defense lawyers say their clients are skydiving experts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the three sky divers who parachuted off the 1 World Trade Center tower on a September 2013 night left a note for his mother before the covert jump. “Sorry mom, for what it’s worth,” the jumper, Andrew Rossig, wrote. “But I had to write some history.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/09/nyregion/09WTC/09WTC-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/09/nyregion/09WTC/09WTC-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/09/nyregion/09WTC/09WTC-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/09/nyregion/09WTC/09WTC-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/09/nyregion/09WTC/09WTC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/09/nyregion/09WTC/09WTC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/09/nyregion/09WTC/09WTC-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'World Trade Center Parachutists Go on Trial', 'kick