ur of his Lower East Side space.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/09/t-magazine/tony-oursler-home-studio-tour.html', 'snippet': 'Ahead of the international photography festival Les Rencontres d’Arles, the artist takes T on a tour of his Lower East Side space.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Sorry — this place is a total wreck,” says the video artist Tony Oursler of his Manhattan home and studio, which is in a constant state of precariousness: Touch one thing and three more take a tumble. “But that’s the fun of it! You’re in the midst of moviemaking magic,” he continues, and it’s true. Ahead of the international photography festival Les Rencontres d’Arles, the sets and props for his upcoming immersive 3D film occupy part of the building’s first floor and a model theater fills the rest. (The basement serves as an editing room for Oursler and his team.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Inside Tony Oursler’s House of ESP Cards (Among Other Ephemera)', 'kicker': 'Home and Work', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-06-09T04:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TDesign', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hilary Moss', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hilary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moss', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8cb03335-e471-5478-bd46-2b454f514005', 'word_count': 243, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8cb03335-e471-5478-bd46-2b454f514005'}, {'abstract': 'The 86-year-old Op Art legend brings his kaleidoscopic vision to a collection of one-of-a-kind silk scarves for Hermès.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/09/t-magazine/julio-le-parc-hermes.html', 'snippet': 'The 86-year-old Op Art legend brings his kaleidoscopic vision to a collection of one-of-a-kind silk scarves for