a31d3'}, {'abstract': 'The administration should listen to the medical profession when it says there is no valid reason to bar transgender people from service.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/09/opinion/what-doctors-say-about-transgender-troops.html', 'snippet': 'The administration should listen to the medical profession when it says there is no valid reason to bar transgender people from service.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The American Medical Association on Monday challenged the military’s policy barring transgender troops, stating  in a resolution that there is “no medically valid reason” to disqualify them from serving. The association urged the Defense Department to offer medical care to transgender troops consistent with the type of treatment that is readily available to civilians.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/09/opinion/09tue3web/09tue3web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/09/opinion/09tue3web/09tue3web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/09/opinion/09tue3web/09tue3web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/09/opinion/09tue3web/09tue3web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/09/opinion/09tue3web/09tue3web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'lega