article/4295733c-91c0-5079-8351-14ad9ea72724'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: The astronaut Edward White said in 1965 that he felt no fear on his spacewalk.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/09/1965-astronaut-reflects-on-mission/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: The astronaut Edward White said in 1965 that he felt no fear on his spacewalk.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ABOARD THE U.S.S. WASP — Astronaut Edward White said today [June 9] that he had no sensation of fear when he began his walk in space. One of three sailors invited to lunch with Maj. White told reporters that Maj. White also said the ‘‘gun’’ he used to maneuver himself in space was ‘‘quite effective.’’ ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/blogs/10iht-oldjune10-white/10iht-oldjune10-white-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 604, 'width': 475, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/blogs/10iht-oldjune10-white/10iht-oldjune10-white-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 604, 'width': 475, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/blogs/10iht-oldjune10-white/10iht-oldjune10-white-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/10/blogs/10iht-oldjune10-white/10iht-oldjune10-white-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/blogs/10iht-oldjune10-white/10iht-oldjune10-white-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'c