tps://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/10/us/the-case-against-dennis-hastert.html', 'snippet': 'The former speaker of the House pleaded not guilty to federal charges on Tuesday afternoon in Chicago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — On Tuesday, J. Dennis Hastert, a former Illinois congressman, appeared in federal court in Chicago to plead not guilty to charges that he structured cash withdrawals from banks to avoid detection and then lied to federal investigators about it. Mr. Hastert used the money to pay a former student — known only as Individual A — to not disclose that Mr. Hastert had sexually abused him decades ago, people briefed on the federal investigation have said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/us/HASTERT/HASTERT-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/10/us/HASTERT/HASTERT-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/us/HASTERT/HASTERT-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/us/HASTERT/HASTERT-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/us/HASTERT/HASTERT-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/10/us/HASTERT/HASTERT-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': '