o', '_id': 'nyt://video/1d68967c-b45d-5df7-a853-bbfc1b56a505', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/1d68967c-b45d-5df7-a853-bbfc1b56a505'}, {'abstract': 'Community leaders and activists voiced frustration with the pace of the official response to the death of the 12-year-old, who was fatally shot on Nov. 22.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/10/us/group-asks-court-to-order-arrest-of-cleveland-officers-in-tamir-rice-case.html', 'snippet': 'Community leaders and activists voiced frustration with the pace of the official response to the death of the 12-year-old, who was fatally shot on Nov. 22.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than six months after a Cleveland police officer fatally shot a 12-year-old boy, community leaders and activists on Tuesday made an unusual bid to bypass the usual legal process by directly petitioning a court to file criminal charges and order the arrest of the officer and his partner.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Group Asks Court to Order Arrest of Cleveland Officers in Tamir Rice Case', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Petition Seeks Charges in 12-Year-Old’s Death', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cleveland (Ohio)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rice, Tamir E (2002-14)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Loehmann, Timothy (1988- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garmback, Frank (1967- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-09T19:00:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Pérez-Peña', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pérez-Peña', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 're