, says it will work with regulators to assure that China’s markets are prepared for the move.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/10/business/dealbook/global-index-may-add-chinese-stocks-fueling-investment.html', 'snippet': 'MSCI, which compiles the index, says it will work with regulators to assure that China’s markets are prepared for the move.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — Chinese stocks do not really need an extra boost. They have tripled in value over the last year to nearly $10 trillion — overtaking Japan, Hong Kong and Britain and coming in second only to the United States.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/business/10DB-MSCI/10DB-MSCI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/10/business/10DB-MSCI/10DB-MSCI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/business/10DB-MSCI/10DB-MSCI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/business/10DB-MSCI/10DB-MSCI-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/business/10DB-MSCI/10DB-MSCI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/10/business/10DB-MSCI/10DB-MSCI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None