dly-bows-out-of-pacific-northwest-ballet.html', 'snippet': 'This Seattle troupe paid tribute to six departing dancers in a program that emphasized Balanchine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEATTLE — All ballet companies become like families in their internal dynamics; in my experience, however, none gather dancers and audience together with the intimacy of Pacific Northwest Ballet. Almost every performance has a preshow educational talk and a postshow conversation with one or more \xa0individual dancers (most questions are from the audience), and each season ends with a gala-like occasion honoring each departing performer. I was here on Sunday night to watch the farewell performance of Carla Körbes, one of the most marvelous ballerinas of our day. But that occasion proved to be about more than one dancer.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/arts/10SEATTLEDANCE/10SEATTLEDANCE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 635, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/10/arts/10SEATTLEDANCE/10SEATTLEDANCE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 635}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/arts/10SEATTLEDANCE/10SEATTLEDANCE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 968, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/arts/10SEATTLEDANCE/10SEATTLEDANCE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1936, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/arts/10SEATTLEDANCE/10SEATTLEDANCE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 