eation center.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/10/nyregion/the-high-bridge-a-path-linking-manhattan-and-the-bronx-reopens-after-40-years.html', 'snippet': 'The $61.8 million restoration of the bridge that links Manhattan and the Bronx, part of a plan by former Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg, includes an improved park and recreation center.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was not built to give New Yorkers expansive views of the Harlem River or a pedestrian shortcut between the Bronx and Manhattan. Rather, the monumental structure that is known as the High Bridge and echoes a Roman aqueduct opened in 1848 to bring fresh water from Westchester County to a booming young city.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/nyregion/HIGHBRIDGE2/HIGHBRIDGE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/10/nyregion/HIGHBRIDGE2/HIGHBRIDGE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/nyregion/HIGHBRIDGE2/HIGHBRIDGE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/nyregion/HIGHBRIDGE2/HIGHBRIDGE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/nyregion/HIGHBRIDGE2/HIGHBRIDGE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/10/nyregion/HIGHBRIDGE2/HIGHBRIDGE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbna