voice-meant-to-be-spoken.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Herrera, who was named poet laureate of the United States on Wednesday, understands people who are drained from the day’s hassle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The poet laureate of the United States — PLOTUS, in the lingo — tends to be busy, Howard Nemerov once said, because he or she spends so much time explaining what the job entails.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Juan Felipe Herrera, Poet Laureate With a Working-Class Voice Meant to Be Spoken', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Working-Class Voice Meant to Be Spoken', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garner, Dwight', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Herrera, Juan Felipe', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poetry and Poets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poets Laureate', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-10T04:05:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dwight Garner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dwight', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Garner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bab911c0-c8db-5a82-916b-a2a18f91f20b', 'word_count': 699, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bab911c0-c8db-5a82-916b-a2a18f91f20b'}, {'abstract': 'A 26-year-old gunman was shot by police after he shot and injured a 21-year-old man in East Harlem, the police said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/10/nyregion/new-york-police-detective-shoots-gunman-who-wounded-man.html', 'snippet': 'A 26-year-old gunman was shot by police after he shot and injured a 21-year-old man in East 