cle/8875a3e2-86a6-5332-96ce-a9603dfad87d'}, {'abstract': 'Jeb Bush labeled President Vladimir V. Putin of Russia a “bully” and said that attempts to send him subtle signals were futile.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/06/10/jeb-bush-in-berlin-says-west-is-confronting-a-more-aggressive-putin/', 'snippet': 'Jeb Bush labeled President Vladimir V. Putin of Russia a “bully” and said that attempts to send him subtle signals were futile.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Jeb Bush said on Wednesday that the West was confronting a “different” Vladimir V. Putin from the man who has led Russia in the past, escalating his reproach of an adversary whose territorial ambitions have shaken the United States and its allies in Europe.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jeb Bush, in Berlin, Says West Is Confronting a ‘More Aggressive’ Putin', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bush, Jeb', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Berlin (Germany)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-10T09:26:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Barbaro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barbaro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/386e386c-6140-5b6a-924b-d27ce42b5e10', 'word_count': 348, 'uri': 'nyt://article/386e386c-6140-5b6a-924b-d27ce42b5e10'}, {'abstract': 'Bayer Diabetes Care has marketed and sold products manufactured by Panasonic Healthcare for decades.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/11/business/dealbook/panasonic-healthcare-to-buy-bayer-diabetes-care.html', 'snippet': 'Bayer Diabetes Care has marketed and sold products manufactured by Panasonic Healthcare for decades.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Panasonic Healthcare Holdings of Japan said on Wednesday that it had agreed to acquire the German drug maker Bayer’s diabetes care business for 1.02 billion euros, or about $1.15 billion.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Panasonic Healthcare to Buy Bayer’s Diabetes Business for $1.15 Billion', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Diabetes Unit Sold', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bray, Chad', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Panasonic Healthcare', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bayer AG', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diabetes', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-10T09:27:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chad Bray', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bray', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/35d879fe-0c85-5c93-a562-86903995a95b', 'word_count': 200, 'uri': 'nyt://article/35d879fe-0c85-5c93-a562-86903995a95b'}, {'abstract': 'A reporter is drawn into a family mystery when he finds millions in his father’s home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/14/books/review/the-fixer-by-joseph-finder.html', 'snippet': 'A reporter is drawn into a family mystery when he finds millions in his father’s home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the post-“Gone Girl” thriller era, you’ve got to move your domestic malice along with zip, vigor and a sharp eye for The Way We Live Now. So it serves Joseph Finder well that his new suspense novel \xadincludes tartly informed themes about adult children caring for elderly parents, and the state of print journalism. His protagonist, Rick Hoffman, has abandoned his career as an investigative reporter at a newspaper and now writes puff pieces for a Boston-based city magazine, one of those glossies that stay fat with ads supplementing their fawning-over-the-wealthy \xadeditorial content. ', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/books/review/14TUCKER/14-Tucker-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 599, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/books/review/14TUCKER/14-Tucker-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 599, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/books/review/14TUCKER/14-Tucker-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/14/books/review/14TUCKER/14-Tucker-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/books/review/14TUCKER/14-Tucker-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘The Fixer,’ by Joseph Finder', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Then They Came for Him', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tucker, Ken', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Finder, Joseph', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-10T09:30:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ken Tucker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tucker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/26cfa68c-8203-5ce9-a97d-84b1c2f39727', 'word_count': 574, 'uri': 'nyt://article/26cfa68c-8203-5ce9-a97d-84b1c2f39727'}, {'abstract': 'A new biography traces William L. Shirer’s arc from intrepid foreign correspondent to blacklist victim to mega-best-selling author.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/14/books/review/a-complex-fate-william-l-shirer-and-the-american-century-by-ken-cuthbertson.html', 'snippet': 'A new biography traces William L. Shirer’s arc from intrepid foreign correspondent to blacklist victim to mega-best-selling author.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In November 1957, a Newsweek column called “Where Are They Now?” noted that William L. Shirer, “made famous by his nightly radio reports from Berlin during the early years of the war and by his book ‘Berlin Diary,’ has been off the air nearly 10 years and is now a writer and part-time lecturer.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/books/review/14KULISH/14KULISH-articleLa