o hurt the tourism sector.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/11/world/middleeast/karnak-temple-luxor-egypt-attack.html', 'snippet': 'The explosion in Luxor came about a week after gunmen shot and killed two tourism police officers near the pyramids of Giza, raising fears that militants want to hurt the tourism sector.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — A suicide bomber and two gunmen attacked the Karnak temple in Luxor on Wednesday in the second assault in a week against Egypt’s premier tourist sites, an ominous turn in the violence against the government of President Abdel Fattah el-Sisi.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Militants Hit\xa0Karnak Temple, in 2nd Recent Attack on Egyptian Tourist Sites', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Another Tourist Site, Karnak Temple, Is Struck in Egypt ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kirkpatrick, David D', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sisi, Abdel Fattah el-', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Luxor (Egypt)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Muslim Brotherhood (Egypt)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-10T11:43:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By David D. Kirkpatrick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organiz