rant veterans Daniel Humm and Will Guidara will open a third restaurant, in a building rising on Park Avenue.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The chef Daniel Humm and the restaurateur Will Guidara, who are partners in Eleven Madison Park and the NoMad, will be opening their third restaurant in Manhattan sometime in the next two to three years. It will be in a new office tower at 425 Park Avenue (56th Street), which is being developed by the real estate company L&L Holding with other partners. The news was announced on Wednesday morning at a groundbreaking ceremony.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/dining/10Humm/10Humm-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 830, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/10/dining/10Humm/10Humm-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 830}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/dining/10Humm/10Humm-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 741, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/dining/10Humm/10Humm-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2000, 'width': 1446, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/dining/10Humm/10Humm-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/10/dining/10Humm/10Humm-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/10/dining/10Humm/10Humm-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumb