 mowed down their reinforcements with a curtain of machine-gun fire. There were conflicting reports on the U.S. casualty breakdown. The number of dead ranged from a State Department report in Washington of seven dead and 13 wounded to an official Saigon report of eight dead, ten missing and 13 wounded. — New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, June 11, 1965', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/11/blogs/11iht-oldjune11-war/11iht-oldjune11-war-articleLarge.png', 'height': 536, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/11/blogs/11iht-oldjune11-war/11iht-oldjune11-war-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 536}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/11/blogs/11iht-oldjune11-war/11iht-oldjune11-war-jumbo.png', 'height': 826, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/11/blogs/11iht-oldjune11-war/11iht-oldjune11-war-superJumbo.png', 'height': 826, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/11/blogs/11iht-oldjune11-war/11iht-oldjune11-war-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/11/blogs/11iht-oldjune11-war/11iht-oldjune11-war-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/11/blogs/11iht-oldjune11-war/11iht-oldjune11-war-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thum