46-5434-8fef-6da100b4b751'}, {'abstract': 'The Metro Council voted to drop the plan, despite backing by the mayor and years after a devastating and deadly flood in Tennessee’s capital in 2010.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/11/us/nashville-council-rejects-100-million-flood-protection-plan.html', 'snippet': 'The Metro Council voted to drop the plan, despite backing by the mayor and years after a devastating and deadly flood in Tennessee’s capital in 2010.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA — The Metro Council in Nashville rejected a contentious $100 million flood-protection proposal Tuesday night that had been criticized for focusing on the downtown area at the expense of other, lower-profile neighborhoods in the Tennessee capital. The proposal had been heavily promoted by Mayor Karl Dean.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nashville Council Rejects $100 Million Flood-Protection Plan', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Floods', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cumberland River', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nashville (Tenn)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-10T16:45:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Fausset', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fausset', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1813f750-8522-5207-8d77-c562e13b23d7', 'word_count': 396, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1813f750-8522-5207-8d77-c562e13b23d7'}, {'abstract': 'Harold Bloom explains the spiritual dimension of social liberalism.', 'web_url': 'https://douthat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/10/caitlyn-jenner-and-the-american-religion/', 'snippet': 'Harold Bloom explains the spiritual dimension of social liberalism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’ve seen a few people quoting this Will Wilkinson essaylet on Caitlyn/Bruce and American Christianity, and it deserves to be quoted:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Caitlyn Jenner and the American Religion', 'kicker': 'Ross Douthat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christians and Christianity', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Liberalism (US Politics)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mormons (Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-Day Saints)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Transgender and Transsexuals', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Aquinas, Thomas (1225-75)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barton, David', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloom, Harold', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dollar, Creflo', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Linker, Damon', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Osteen, Joel', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rieff, Philip', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tolle, Eckhart', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Winfrey, Oprah', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Esalen Institute', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 16, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New England States (US)', 'rank': 17, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 18, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-10T16:48:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Op