tract': '“I Left My Noodle on Ramen Street” is part monograph, part scrapbooked personal history.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/10/devendra-banhart-noodle-ramen-street-book/', 'snippet': '“I Left My Noodle on Ramen Street” is part monograph, part scrapbooked personal history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Devendra Banhart is exactly the sort of person for whom the term “multihyphenate” was coined. Though he’s attained a measure of mainstream notoriety as a musician, his undergraduate degree is in the visual arts, and for the last 15 or so years he has been steadily building, and occasionally exhibiting, a parallel body of work around drawings, paintings and, more recently, photography. “When you dedicate enough time to anything,” Banhart explains, “if the motives aren’t 100 percent egoic, then some things start to come to fruition.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Art Book from Devendra Banhart that’s as Eclectic as the Man Himself', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Noodles', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Banhart, Devendra', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Darger, Henry', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Deitch, Jeffrey', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Green, Adam', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Strand Bookstore (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Walker Art Center', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-10T20:45:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazi