ible candidate to be Myanmar’s next leader.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — Daw Aung San Suu Kyi, the Nobel Peace laureate who leads Myanmar’s opposition, met with President Xi Jinping of China on Thursday, the second day of a trip that appears likely to underscore her transformation from a global icon of democracy to a politician with ambitions to form her country’s next government.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Aung San Suu Kyi of Myanmar Meets With Xi Jinping in Beijing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Aung San Suu Kyi Meets With Beijing Leadership ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Forsythe, Michael', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Myanmar', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Aung San Suu Kyi', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Xi Jinping', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu Xiaobo', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National League for Democracy (Myanmar)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Communist Party of China', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-11T11:10:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Forsythe', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Forsythe', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2e544ab0-2181-5e1c-8ebb-673db2771375', 'word_count': 803, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2e544ab0-2181-5e1c-8ebb-673db2771375'}, {'abstract': 'The first lady is the first guest editor for the lifestyle publication aimed at women. The issue will be available on newsstands on June 23.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/12/business/media/michelle-obama-guest-edits-issue-of-more-magazine.html', 'snippet': 'The first lady is the first guest editor for the lifestyle publication aimed at women. The issue will be available on newsstands on June 23.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Michelle Obama has been on the cover of many magazines, including Vogue and Time. To go along with her latest appearance, she has also had a bigger role behind the scenes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/11/business/12more-web/12more-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 421, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/11/business/12more-web/12more-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 421}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/11/business/12more-web/12more-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/11/business/12more-web/12more-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1437, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/11/business/12more-web/12more-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/11/business/12more-web/12more-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '