ef executive, Millard S. Drexler, and the two private equity firms in 2011, Ms. Creswell writes. J. Crew executives blamed the most recent quarterly losses on some fashion mistakes, like the cropped “Tilly” sweater, and on Wednesday the company said it had replaced the head of women’s design and will cut 175 jobs. However,  in the Deal Professor column, Steven Davidoff Solomon contends that J. Crew doesn’t just have a fashion problem – it has a “great man” problem. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Morning Agenda: J. Crew’s ‘Great Man’ Problem', 'kicker': 'News', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cyberattacks and Hackers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hedge Funds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Private Equity', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shareholder Rights and Activism', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Venture Capital', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'J Crew Group', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Leonard Green & Partners', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MERGERS, ACQUISITIONS AND DIVESTITURES', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Royal Bank of Scotland PLC', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'TPG Capital', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-11T11:26:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs