 to strengthen their perimeter around the area after dark and halt searching until daylight.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/12/nyregion/escaped-convicts-richard-matt-david-sweat-clinton-correctional-facility-dannemora-search.html', 'snippet': 'After a full day of hunting in thick woods, State Police troopers were preparing to strengthen their perimeter around the area after dark and halt searching until daylight.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CADYVILLE, N.Y. — In a six-day manhunt that has touched on locations as varied as the streets of Philadelphia to an island in Lake Champlain, law enforcement officers searching for two convicted murderers on Thursday largely narrowed their efforts to a five-square-mile area just east of the prison from which they escaped.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/nyregion/12MANHUNTy/12MANHUNTy-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/12/nyregion/12MANHUNTy/12MANHUNTy-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/nyregion/12MANHUNTy/12MANHUNTy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/nyregion/12MANHUNTy/12MANHUNTy-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/nyregion/12MANHUNTy/12MANHUNTy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnai