rds, made an indelible mark in roles like Count Dracula, Frankenstein’s monster and Saruman in the “Lord of the Rings” movies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Christopher Lee, the physically towering British movie actor who lent his distinguished good looks, Shakespearean voice and aristocratic presence to a gallery of villains, from a seductive Count Dracula to a dreaded wizard in “The Lord of the Rings,” died on Sunday in London. He was 93.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12lee-2-obit-web/12lee-2-obit-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 619, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12lee-2-obit-web/12lee-2-obit-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 619}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12lee-2-obit-web/12lee-2-obit-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 993, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12lee-2-obit-web/12lee-2-obit-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1857, 'width': 1800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12lee-2-obit-web/12lee-2-obit-web-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12lee-2-obit-web/12lee-2-obit-web-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12lee-2-obit-web/12lee-2-obit-web-thumbLarge-v2.