e of the Internacional Design Hotel in the Baixa neighborhood, was aiming for when he opened Bastardo in September. The brightly lit, 50-seat space has a colorful Pop Art aesthetic: mismatched tables and chairs, Lego block bread baskets and paper settings in bold font declaring “on this magic place mat calories don’t count,” and prices to match.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/travel/07BITES/07BITES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/07/travel/07BITES/07BITES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/travel/07BITES/07BITES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/travel/07BITES/07BITES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 799, 'width': 1199, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/travel/07BITES/07BITES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/07/travel/07BITES/07BITES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/07/travel/07BITES/07BITES-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Restaurant Report: Bastardo in Lisbon', 'kicker': 'Bites', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Playful Mouthful', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lisbon (Portugal)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Portugal', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-11T15:57:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rachel Friedman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rachel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Friedman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d4e2069e-2e36-548e-bbb7-3b8f435cec77', 'word_count': 336, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d4e2069e-2e36-548e-bbb7-3b8f435cec77'}, {'abstract': 'A panel of judges will investigate whether the airline or any individuals bear responsibility for failing to monitor the psychological health of the co-pilot who crashed the plane.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/12/world/europe/germanwings-crash-criminal-inquiry-planned-by-france.html', 'snippet': 'A panel of judges will investigate whether the airline or any individuals bear responsibility for failing to monitor the psychological health of the co-pilot who crashed the plane.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — A French prosecutor on Thursday formally opened a criminal inquiry into the crash of a Germanwings jetliner, appointing a panel of judges to investigate whether the airline or any individuals should bear responsibility for failing to adequately monitor the psychological health of the plane’s co-pilot, who is believed to have deliberately crashed the plane.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype