ucts to cleanse, exfoliate, moisturize and protect.', 'lead_paragraph': 'These days, with the ever-expanding offering of skincare products designed specifically for men, a grooming regime like Patrick Bateman’s in “American Psycho” — the fictional investment banker used daily various cleansers, lotions and even an ice-pack — is quickly becoming commonplace for the modern man. And who’s to say there’s anything wrong with that? A good epidermis, especially in the harsh summer months, can be just what a guy needs to remain looking fresh and feeling good. Here, some of the season’s best products to cleanse, exfoliate, moisturize and protect the skin.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/11/t-magazine/11grooming-tudela/11grooming-tudela-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/11/t-magazine/11grooming-tudela/11grooming-tudela-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/11/t-magazine/11grooming-tudela/11grooming-tudela-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/11/t-magazine/11grooming-tudela/11grooming-tudela-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/11/t-magazine/11grooming-tudela/11grooming-tudela-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/11/t-magazine/11groomi