 I felt a need to apologize for my creative side.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/14/style/whimsy-just-doesnt-show-up-on-a-spreadsheet.html', 'snippet': 'I always felt ashamed of my quantitative deficiencies, just as I felt a need to apologize for my creative side.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I have a soft spot for economists. I fell for a number of them and was fascinated by their thought processes, which struck me as so efficient, how they sized things up and appraised value with one glance. Their minds seemed to operate in ways mine never did.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/fashion/14MODERN/14MODERN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 795, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/14/fashion/14MODERN/14MODERN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 795}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/fashion/14MODERN/14MODERN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 773, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/fashion/14MODERN/14MODERN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1546, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/fashion/14MODERN/14MODERN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/14/fashion/14MODERN/14MODERN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/fashion/14MOD