what they can after a flood that has reached 37 feet, close to a historic peak in 1945.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/12/us/property-damage-worsens-in-louisiana-as-flooding-continues.html', 'snippet': 'Residents are trying to gather what they can after a flood that has reached 37 feet, close to a historic peak in 1945.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SHREVEPORT, La. — Sheriff Steve Prator of Caddo Parish can barely recognize his house near Twelve Mile Bayou and the Red River in northern Shreveport.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/us/12flood-web01/12flood-web01-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 357, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/12/us/12flood-web01/12flood-web01-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 357}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/us/12flood-web01/12flood-web01-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 610, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/us/12flood-web01/12flood-web01-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1219, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/us/12flood-web01/12flood-web01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/12/us/12flood-web01/12flood-web01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/us/12flood-web01/12flood-web01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Shreveport Battles the Ravages of the Mighty Red', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Shreveport Battles the Ravages of the Mighty Red', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Floods', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Red River of the South', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Shreveport (La)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Louisiana', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-11T19:57:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Derick Jones', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Derick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jones', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/55cb3869-25c7-542f-bef6-e7ef63fd5327', 'word_count': 820, 'uri': 'nyt://article/55cb3869-25c7-542f-bef6-e7ef63fd5327'}, {'abstract': '“The Magic Word,” a short film created for Peroni Nastro Azzuro’s Grazie Cinema Series, premieres online here.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/11/tracy-antonopoulos-gia-coppola-the-magic-word-film/', 'snippet': '“The Magic Word,” a short film created for Peroni Nastro Azzuro’s Grazie Cinema Series, premieres online here.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It wasn’t hard to conceptualize,” says the director Tracy Antonopoulos of her new short film “The Magic Word,” created in partnership with Peroni Nastro Azzuro for its summer Grazie Cinema Series, which debuted this week and is curated by Antonopoulos’s good friend and collaborator Gia Coppola. The five-minute film premieres online here, and begins in black and white as a girl (played by Courtney Falsey) wanders into a cafe dotted with patrons crying and looking down at their tables sullenly. After finally making eye contact with the inattentive bartender, the girl says a simple “grazie,” and the entire scene changes to a fanciful, colorful place of joy. “It’s really just about moody girls who get frustrated with the world,” Antonopoulos says bluntly. “And Fellini films, Italian cinema in general. I wanted the message to ultimately be that life can be a little bit more fun. The Italians kind of do that best.” Coppola concurs: “The film shows the lead character interacting with the world in a fun and kind manner, which is what I feel the word ‘grazie’ means,” she says. “Thanking, celebrating and saying cheers.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tracy Antonopoulos and Gia Coppola Team Up to Salute (and Wink at) Italian Cinema', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Antonopoulos, Tracy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coppola, Gia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-11T20:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooke Bobb', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooke', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bobb', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0afff136-7c40-54ec-9efb-218692bb0fdc', 'word_count': 307, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0afff136-7c40-54ec-9efb-218692bb0fdc'}, {'abstract': 'Janine Weber signed with the New York Riveters of the National Women’s Hockey League, a new competitor for the established but nonpaying Canadian Women’s Hockey League.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/12/sports/hockey/womens-pro-league-offering-pay-signs-its-first-player.html', 'snippet': 'Janine Weber signed with the New York Riveters of the National Women’s Hockey League, a new competitor for the established but nonpaying Canadian Women’s Hockey League.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Janine Weber became the first player to join the newly formed National Women’s Hockey League on Thursday, signing a free-agent contract with the New York Riveters.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Women’s Pro League Offering Pay Signs Its First Player', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Women&#8217;s Pro Hockey League Signs Its First Player', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "National Women's Hockey League", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Canadian Women's Hockey League", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rylan, Dani (1987- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-11T20:05:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Seth Berkman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Seth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berkman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c3826320-1db4-548d-8fbe-d26a0fec216f', 'word_count': 526, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c3826320-1db4-548d-8fbe-d26a0fec216f'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Oehlen, one of the most noted artists of postwar Germany, reveals cross-fertilized chaos in this show at the New Museum.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/12/arts/design/review-albert-oehlen-a-master-of-disciplined-excess.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Oehlen, one of the most noted artists of postwar Germany, reveals cross-fertilized chaos in this show at the New Museum.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The German artist Albert Oehlen has been painting up a storm for more than 30 years, producing canvases that promulgate one kind of cross-fertilized chaos or another. The usual components include angst-free Abstract Expressionist brushwork, bits of popular advertising imagery, Surrealist automatist scribbles, spray-can vapor trails reminiscent of graffiti art and, at times, composite images built on the computer.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12OEHLEN/12OEHLEN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 559, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12OEHLEN/12OEHLEN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 559}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12OEHLEN/12OEHLEN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 955, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12OEHLEN/12OEHLEN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1910, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12OEHLEN/12OEHLEN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12OEHLEN/12OEHLEN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12OEHLEN/12OEHLEN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy