e. For Ms. Snyder, painting functions as a kind of scrapbook, diary, garden journal and bulletin board.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12SNYDERGALLERY5/12SNYDERGALLERY5-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 301, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12SNYDERGALLERY5/12SNYDERGALLERY5-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 301}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12SNYDERGALLERY5/12SNYDERGALLERY5-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 514, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12SNYDERGALLERY5/12SNYDERGALLERY5-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1027, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12SNYDERGALLERY5/12SNYDERGALLERY5-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12SNYDERGALLERY5/12SNYDERGALLERY5-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/arts/12SNYDERGALLERY5/12SNYDERGALLERY5-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: From Joan Snyder, a Profusion of Flowers at Franklin Parrasch', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Review: From Joan Snyder, a Profusion of Flowers at Franklin Par