 deadly clashes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/12/world/middleeast/israeli-report-backs-tactics-by-military-in-gaza-war.html', 'snippet': 'Ahead of a U.N. commission report, the Israeli military issued an update on its internal inquiries, saying neither Israeli nor international laws were broken in several deadly clashes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — With a United Nations commission expected to soon release its report on last summer’s war between Israel and Palestinian militants in the Gaza Strip, the Israeli military late Thursday issued an update on its internal inquiries, saying neither Israeli nor international laws were broken in several attacks that led to civilian deaths.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Israeli Report Backs Tactics by Military in Gaza War', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Israeli Report Backs Tactics by Military in Gaza War', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rudoren, Jodi', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gaza Strip', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War Crimes, Genocide and Crimes Against Humanity', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations Human Rights Council', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-12T00:09:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World',