ippet': 'Stevan Ridley, who tore the anterior cruciate and medial collateral ligaments in his right knee in his final year before free agency, got a one-year contract from the Jets worth $1.25 million.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLORHAM PARK, N.J. — When Stevan Ridley excelled as a running back at Louisiana State, he dreamed of earning a lucrative N.F.L. contract one day and the material pleasures it would bring. When he signed a relatively modest deal as a third-round draft choice of the New England Patriots in 2011, he drew motivation from knowing that free agency could yield the big money he desired once he proved himself.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Knee Injury Also Hurts Finances of New Jet', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Knee Injury Also Hurts Finances Of New Jet', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ridley, Stevan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bowles, Todd (1963- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-12T02:28:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Pedulla', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pedulla', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e1e36e29-9465-5330-9bcd-e8bb5e05d638', 'word_count': 673, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e1e36e29-9465-5330-9bcd-e8bb5e05d638'}, {'abstract': 'Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo said he was trying to play mediator by getting Assembly to approve the tax credits and the Senate to continue rent regulations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/