ier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d706000-03d6-5285-9019-d04d8b937c7d', 'word_count': 1044, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d706000-03d6-5285-9019-d04d8b937c7d'}, {'abstract': 'Before he died of burns, the journalist, Jagendra Singh, said police officers and associates of a local official had set him afire. The police said they were investigating.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/12/world/asia/indian-journalist-who-linked-official-to-graft-dies.html', 'snippet': 'Before he died of burns, the journalist, Jagendra Singh, said police officers and associates of a local official had set him afire. The police said they were investigating.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — They came in the heat of the late afternoon, two cars jammed with enforcers and police officers allied with a local dairy minister. They charged into the reporter’s house and reminded him that he had been warned many times that “he should not write anything against the minister.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Indian Journalist Who Linked Official to Graft Dies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Singh, Jagendra (d 2015)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Committee to Protect Journalists', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Verma, Ram Murti (1965- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-12T03:13:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byli