abstract': 'A veteran detective says fraud schemes by psychics are not uncommon, although they are typically pulled off in amounts smaller than the $713,975 a woman was accused of taking from a client.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/13/nyregion/criminal-psychics-see-a-clear-path-with-the-desperate-a-detective-says.html', 'snippet': 'A veteran detective says fraud schemes by psychics are not uncommon, although they are typically pulled off in amounts smaller than the $713,975 a woman was accused of taking from a client.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A detective paused between bites of a late lunch on Wednesday in a Midtown diner and said, “It’s not very often you see a customer in a psychic shop.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/nyregion/13CRIMESCENE2/13CRIMESCENE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/13/nyregion/13CRIMESCENE2/13CRIMESCENE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/nyregion/13CRIMESCENE2/13CRIMESCENE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/nyregion/13CRIMESCENE2/13CRIMESCENE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/nyregion/13CRIMESCENE2/13CRIMESCENE2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/13/nyregion/