}, {'abstract': 'A steep drop in home prices, high consumer debt, unexpected expenses and other factors keep workers from owning their homes outright before retiring.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/13/your-money/paying-off-the-mortgage-is-becoming-harder-for-older-workers.html', 'snippet': 'A steep drop in home prices, high consumer debt, unexpected expenses and other factors keep workers from owning their homes outright before retiring.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LIKE Archie Bunker, who celebrated paying off his home mortgage by burning his documents in a 1975 episode of “All in the Family,” many workers once routinely timed retirement to coincide with paying off a mortgage.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/business/13retiring-web/13retiring-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/12/business/13retiring-web/13retiring-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/business/13retiring-web/13retiring-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/business/13retiring-web/13retiring-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/business/13retiring-web/13retiring-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/12/business/13retiring-w