as a homecoming of sorts for the band, played in front of familiar faces and T-shirts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/13/arts/music/review-a-reunited-luna-plays-brooklyns-northside-festival.html', 'snippet': 'The concert in McCarren Park was a homecoming of sorts for the band, played in front of familiar faces and T-shirts.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It is a pretty momentous occasion,” Sean Eden of Luna calmly observed between songs at the band’s concert on Thursday evening in McCarren Park in Greenpoint. It was a homecoming of sorts: the first New York City appearance in a decade by a band that had distilled a certain New York sound. It was also the first big concert of this year’s Northside Festival, which is striving to become Brooklyn’s version of the South by Southwest festival in Austin and continues through the weekend.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/arts/LUNA/LUNA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 369, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/13/arts/LUNA/LUNA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 369}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/arts/LUNA/LUNA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 630, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/arts/LUNA/LUNA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1259, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/arts/LUNA/LUNA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'imag