te over the hard-line policy on illegal immigrants that helped Prime Minister Tony Abbott win office in 2013 but exposed Australia to pointed criticism by United Nations agencies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GENEVA — Asian migrants on a boat that was intercepted by the Australian authorities three weeks ago have told refugee workers that the Australians paid the smugglers to take them back to Indonesia, a United Nations official said on Friday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Asian Migrants Say Australia Paid Smugglers to Turn Back ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Asian Migrants Say Australia Paid Smugglers to Turn Back ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cumming-Bruce, Nick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abbott, Tony', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cochrane, Joe', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Indonesia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Trafficking', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-13T01:51:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Cumming-Bruce and Joe Cochrane', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cumming-Bruce', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cochrane', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization