ila Grill in Bay Shore, Little Mexico Bar & Restaurant in Westbury or Chichimecas in Farmingdale, Long Islanders can get their fills of the Mexican staple.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/14/nyregion/long-island-restaurants-serve-up-tacos-for-summer.html', 'snippet': 'Whether it’s Pico Tequila Grill in Bay Shore, Little Mexico Bar & Restaurant in Westbury or Chichimecas in Farmingdale, Long Islanders can get their fills of the Mexican staple.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Long Island Railroad train periodically roared past Chichimecas Music and TAM Bar Restaurant in Farmingdale on a recent evening, but diners paid no mind. They were listening instead to Alejandro Gonzalez as he played a rousing guitar duet of “Guantanamera” with a fellow musician. The dining room, festooned with colorful Mexican flags, woven serape tablecloths, maracas and murals, captured the mood of a neighborhood social club buoyed by food, music and margaritas.', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/nyregion/14DINELI2/14DINELI2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/14/nyregion/14DINELI2/14DINELI2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/nyregion/14DINELI2/14DINELI2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/nyregion/14DINELI2/14DINELI2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2000, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'i