surroundings, with regionally influenced American classics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Coolness, in a restaurant or any other endeavor, is an elusive quality to pin down. A place that’s cool has to be stylish, but without seeming like it’s trying too hard. It may be unusual, even offbeat, but it can’t be off-putting. And it must somehow convey both exclusivity and affability. A cool hangout might make you feel a little self-conscious the first time you walk in, but you relax quickly. Because being welcomed there means you must be cool, too.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/nyregion/14DINECT23-COMBO/14CINECT23-COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/14/nyregion/14DINECT23-COMBO/14CINECT23-COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1200}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/nyregion/14DINECT23-COMBO/14CINECT23-COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 512, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/nyregion/14DINECT23-COMBO/14CINECT23-COMBO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/nyregion/14DINECT23-COMBO/14CINECT23-COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/14/nyregion/14DINECT23-COMBO/14CINECT23-COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'cap