d8-bbb4-de92f2ec802d'}, {'abstract': 'A miscommunication between Brian McCann and Mark Teixeira was the latest costly mistake for the Yankees, who fell into a virtual tie with Tampa Bay after the loss.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/14/sports/baseball/more-defensive-gaffes-bedevil-the-yankees-in-their-second-straight-loss.html', 'snippet': 'A miscommunication between Brian McCann and Mark Teixeira was the latest costly mistake for the Yankees, who fell into a virtual tie with Tampa Bay after the loss.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BALTIMORE — For the second night in a row, the Yankees were troubled by an embarrassing failure to communicate. On Friday, two outfielders looked at each other as a fly ball landed between them, and it was catcher Brian McCann and Mark Teixeira who politely bumbled on Saturday. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/sports/14YANKEES/14YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 481, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/14/sports/14YANKEES/14YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 481}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/sports/14YANKEES/14YANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 821, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/sports/14YANKEES/14YANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1642, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/sports/14YANKEES/14YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/14/sports/14YANKEES/14YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/sports/14YANKEES/14YANKEES-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'More Defensive Gaffes Bedevil the Yankees in Their Second Straight Loss ', 'kicker': 'Orioles 9, Yankees 4', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'More Defensive Breakdowns Bedevil the Yankees in a Second Straight Loss ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Witz, Billy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rodriguez, Alex', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCann, Brian (1984- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baltimore Orioles', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-14T03:15:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Billy Witz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Billy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Witz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8322e17-041b-55a0-9313-6aa7d952a926', 'word_count': 830, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8322e17-041b-55a0-9313-6aa7d952a926'}, {'abstract': 'Hillary Rodham Clinton flew to Iowa on Saturday evening to urge Democrats to sign on to her presidential team rather than remain open to overtures from the growing political operations of Bernie Sanders and Martin O’Malley.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/