s/30000-fans-greet-american-pharoah-in-festive-return-to-churchill-downs.html', 'snippet': 'Cloaked in white cloth, American Pharoah was paraded like a war hero at the racetrack where he began his path to horse racing immortality with a win in the Kentucky Derby.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOUISVILLE, Ky. — On a hot and humid day, American Pharoah, the 12th Triple Crown winner, returned to a king’s homecoming at Churchill Downs. The euphoric coronation began Friday, when he returned to the dirt at 6:45 a.m. for a jog. It ended Saturday evening before an estimated crowd of 30,000 who came from near and far to see the bay colt for themselves and fawn over the horse that has revitalized a proud sport.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/sports/14PHAROH1/14PHAROH1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 415, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/14/sports/14PHAROH1/14PHAROH1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 415}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/sports/14PHAROH1/14PHAROH1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 709, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/sports/14PHAROH1/14PHAROH1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1418, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/sports/14PHAROH1/14PHAROH1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/14/sports/14PHAROH1/14PHAROH1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'th