aph': 'PARIS — The disconsolate shopkeepers of the Palais Royal have hit upon a new scheme to attract the public to the comparatively deserted arcades. When the proposal to cut a new street through the gardens was abandoned, M. Martin-Ginouvier proposed to build in the centre of the enclosure a tower, 55 mètres high, of iron and crystal. A modification of this scheme has now been supplied by another architect M. Bourdais, and approved of at a meeting of the principal trade men of the Palais. M. Bourdais proposes to build, near the Galerie d’Orléans, a tower 100 mètres high, not of iron and glass, but of stone. His plans show four platforms, accessible by lifts and a staircase, with, at the summit, a lighthouse powerful enough to light the four central arrondissements. — The New York Herald, European Edition, June 15, 1890', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1890: Palais Royal Tower', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHITECTURE', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-14T14:51:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d5f7ec66-c835-56e2-b0d1-d63207c4fff1', 'word_count': 142, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d5f7ec66-c835-56e2-b0d1-d63207c4fff1'}, {'abstract': 'Clinton Correctional Facility has not allowed visitors since two men escaped a week ago, prompting concerns from family members about how life has changed on the inside.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/15/nyregion/-2015-06-15-nyregion-as-lockdown-continues-wives-of-clinton-correctional-facility-prison-inmates-share-fears.html', 'snippet': 'Clinton Correctional Facility has not allowed visitors since two men escaped a week ago, prompting concerns from family members about how life has changed on the inside.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For nine days, Geneva Perez has been trying to reach her husband in prison. And for nine days, she has been told she cannot talk to him.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/nyregion/14PARTNERS1web/14PARTNERS1web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/14/nyregion/14PARTNERS1web/14PARTNERS1web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/nyregion/14PARTNERS1web/14PARTNERS1web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/nyregion/14PARTNERS1web/14PARTNERS1web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/14/nyregion/14PARTNERS1web/14PARTNERS1web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/14/nyregion/14PARTNERS1web/14PARTNERS1web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'typ