 Bock, is being adapted for Off-Broadway.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/14/adaptation-of-the-rothschilds-to-come-to-broadway/', 'snippet': '“The Rothschilds,” a musical by “Fiddler on the Roof” team Sheldon Harnick and Jerry Bock, is being adapted for Off-Broadway.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Before “Fiddler on the Roof” is revived for the fifth time on Broadway, another production by Sheldon Harnick and Jerry Bock will arrive in New York. “Rothschild & Sons,” a one-act rewrite of the 1970 musical “The Rothschilds,” will make its world debut Off Broadway as a production of the York Theater Company in October. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/15/us/15rothschild/15rothschild-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 619, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/15/us/15rothschild/15rothschild-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 619}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/15/us/15rothschild/15rothschild-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 993, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/15/us/15rothschild/15rothschild-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1986, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/15/us/15rothschild/15rothschild-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/15/us/15rothschild/15rothschild-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLa