restricted trading on June 26.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Europcar, a French rental car company, said on Monday that it planned to sell 854.5 million euros, or about $963 million, in shares in an initial public offering in Paris this month.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Europcar Plans to Sell $963 Million in Shares in Paris I.P.O.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rental-Car I.P.O.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bray, Chad', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Europcar International SASU', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Eurazeo', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Euronext Stock Exchange', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Renting and Leasing', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-15T08:51:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chad Bray', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bray', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f0c2b145-00b4-581e-a5bb-381a2a633fcd', 'word_count': 297, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f0c2b145-00b4-581e-a5bb-381a2a633fcd'}, {'abstract': 'He was expected to be weak among evangelicals and Tea Party voters. But his early weakness has been broader than that.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/16/upshot/jeb-bushs-surprising-struggle-with-moderates.html', 'snippet': 'He was expected to be weak among evangelicals and Tea Party voters. But his early weakness has been broader than that.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was ea