 Marvel is practicing architecture in New York City with his father, Thomas, who in Puerto Rico was one of the most prolific designers of his generation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/16/nyregion/an-architect-works-with-a-source-of-inspiration-his-father.html', 'snippet': 'Jonathan Marvel is practicing architecture in New York City with his father, Thomas, who in Puerto Rico was one of the most prolific designers of his generation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When he was growing up in San Juan, P.R., Jonathan Marvel would often visit his father’s architecture studio, awe-struck by the work around him. Schools, churches, hotels, apartment buildings, plazas and boulevards — seemingly all the things of daily life had come from the pen of his father, Thomas Marvel, one of the most prolific designers of his generation on the island. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/nyregion/16APPRAISAL1/16APPRAISAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/16/nyregion/16APPRAISAL1/16APPRAISAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/nyregion/16APPRAISAL1/16APPRAISAL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/nyregion/16APPRAISAL1/16APPRAISAL1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1392, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/nyregion/16APPRAISAL1/16APPRAISAL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height'