s.com/2015/06/16/nyregion/in-absence-of-sightings-theories-abound-on-escapees-whereabouts.html', 'snippet': 'Residents near the maximum-security prison in Dannemora, N.Y., imagine all kinds of places where the killers might be hiding.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DANNEMORA, N.Y. — There is no evidence that the two murderers who escaped a maximum-security prison here earlier this month are in Mexico, chuckling at investigators. There is no evidence that they are in Italy, Pennsylvania or a hunting camp in northern Quebec. And there is absolutely no evidence that the whole thing — the escape, the hunt, the days of combing the woods — was faked.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/nyregion/16GOSSIP3/16GOSSIP3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/16/nyregion/16GOSSIP3/16GOSSIP3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/nyregion/16GOSSIP3/16GOSSIP3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/nyregion/16GOSSIP3/16GOSSIP3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/nyregion/16GOSSIP3/16GOSSIP3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/16/nyregion/16GOSSIP3/16GOSSIP3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 't