', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/15/concert-by-the-sea-a-jazz-classic-by-erroll-garner-to-be-reissued/', 'snippet': 'Few jazz albums have reached as wide an audience as the pianist Erroll Garner’s “Concert by the Sea,” one of the best-selling jazz albums ever.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Few jazz albums have reached as wide an audience as the pianist Erroll Garner’s “Concert by the Sea.” Recorded in Carmel-by-the-Sea, Calif., in 1955, it was released on Columbia and quickly achieved a rare sort of success — becoming not only a standout moment in Mr. Garner’s career but also an essential touchstone for pianists, and one of the best-selling jazz albums ever.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/arts/music/13garner/13garner-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/13/arts/music/13garner/13garner-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/arts/music/13garner/13garner-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/arts/music/13garner/13garner-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/arts/music/13garner/13garner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/13/arts/music/13garner/13garner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailh