ed the support of Republican elites, as Nate Cohn notes. And he has not scared off other candidates who could hurt him in the primaries, like John Kasich. There is no clever case to be made that Mr. Bush’s campaign has actually performed well this spring.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/upshot/16up-predicts-1434136154149/16up-predicts-1434136154149-articleLarge.png', 'height': 251, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/13/upshot/16up-predicts-1434136154149/16up-predicts-1434136154149-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 251}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/upshot/16up-predicts-1434136154149/16up-predicts-1434136154149-jumbo.png', 'height': 428, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/upshot/16up-predicts-1434136154149/16up-predicts-1434136154149-superJumbo.png', 'height': 687, 'width': 1645, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/upshot/16up-predicts-1434136154149/16up-predicts-1434136154149-thumbStandard-v3.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/13/upshot/16up-predicts-1434136154149/16up-predicts-1434136154149-thumbStandard-v3.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/13/upshot/16up-predicts-1434136154149/16up-predicts-1434136154149-thumbLarge-v3.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLar