ance, a collaboration among Ms. Stenn and others, is performed at Gowanus Loft, near the canal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/16/arts/dance/review-rebecca-stenns-riparius-belonging-to-the-river-in-brooklyn-debut.html', 'snippet': 'The dance, a collaboration among Ms. Stenn and others, is performed at Gowanus Loft, near the canal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Brooklyn, near the Ninth Street Bridge over the notoriously polluted Gowanus Canal, a postindustrial wasteland seems to be in the early stages of gentrification. Amid warehouses with “For Rent” placards, one telling sign of change is the 19th-century factory building that has been converted into the Gowanus Industrial Arts Complex. On the top floor is a clean, white, airy space known as the Gowanus Loft. And it is here that the Rebecca Stenn Company is debuting its new work, “Riparius (Belonging to the River).”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/arts/16STENN/16STENN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/16/arts/16STENN/16STENN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/arts/16STENN/16STENN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/arts/16STENN/16STENN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/arts/16STENN/16STENN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 't