], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c55d9d69-81d3-57cb-b255-2d600cec63a3', 'word_count': 1359, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c55d9d69-81d3-57cb-b255-2d600cec63a3'}, {'abstract': 'The College Board also says it will waive its fees for students who want to take the test again, after an error regarding the allotted time for a reading section on June 6.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/16/education/after-sat-misprint-two-sections-wont-be-scored.html', 'snippet': 'The College Board also says it will waive its fees for students who want to take the test again, after an error regarding the allotted time for a reading section on June 6.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a misprint in test booklets about the time allotted for taking part of the SAT earlier this month, the College Board said on Monday that it would not score two sections of the exam, and would waive its fees for students who wanted to take the test again. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After SAT Misprint, Two Sections Won’t Be Scored', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After SAT Misprint, Board Won&#8217;t Score 2 Sections, and Offers Retest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'SAT (College Admission Test)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'College Board', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tests and Examinations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Educational Testing Service', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-16T00:18:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Motoko Rich', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Motoko', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rich', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bbf48a87-10d6-5c9d-8f8b-d4160c7efb00', 'word_count': 785, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bbf48a87-10d6-5c9d-8f8b-d4160c7efb00'}, {'abstract': 'Miss Lewis began her career as a singer and actress at an early age and was still performing near the end of her life.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/16/arts/music/monica-lewis-dies-at-93-her-apple-pie-appeal-sold-chiquitas-bananas.html', 'snippet': 'Miss Lewis began her career as a singer and actress at an early age and was still performing near the end of her life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Monica Lewis, the dimpled, diminutive chanteuse who made her Broadway debut as a teenager, taught Americans how to ripen their newly imported bananas as the ubiquitous voice of Miss Chiquita, appeared on the inaugural episode of Ed Sullivan’s television variety show in 1948 and durably continued to perform jazz and pop hits for decades, died on Friday at her home in the Woodland Hills area of Los Angeles. She was 93.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/arts/16lewis-obit/16lewis-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 752, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/16/arts/16lewis-obit/16lewis-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 752}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/arts/16lewis-obit/16lewis-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 817, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/arts/16lewis-obit/16lewis-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1634, 'subType':