st-draft/2015/06/16/today-in-politics-ladies-and-gentlemen-mr-donald-trump/', 'snippet': 'Donald Trump day is upon us. The real estate mogul and reality television star, whose numerous feints at running for office haven’t resulted in an actual candidacy, is expected to formally declare his campaign for president on Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good Tuesday morning from Washington, where a confidant of Hillary Rodham Clinton is set to testify to a House committee about the attacks in Benghazi, Libya. As for the presidential candidates, the crowded Republican field finally found room for Jeb Bush, and now, it might have to again move over for a hopeful who needs only one name: Trump.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Today in Politics: Ladies and Gentlemen, Mr. Donald Trump', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-16T11:00:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8f7e00ec-9702-5c6a-86f8-9f3f2e594619', 'word_count': 1181, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8f7e00ec-9702-5c6a-86f8-9f3f2e594619'}, {'abstract': 'Considering the many places his music took him, you would be forgiven for forgetting that, in a deeply rooted sense, Seeger was a New Yorker.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/21/travel/pete-seegers-new-york-roots.html', 'snippet': 'Considering the many places his music took him, you would be forgiven for forgetting that, in a deeply rooted sense, Seeger was a New Yorker.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The poet Carl Sandburg called him America’s 