y to the brand’s slip-on shoes with a summery capsule collection.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/16/takashi-murakami-vans/', 'snippet': 'The artist celebrates his loyalty to the brand’s slip-on shoes with a summery capsule collection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Vans and the contemporary artist Takashi Murakami partnered up to create a lively capsule collection of summer sneakers. The limited-edition designs will be released under the premium Vault by Vans line, with Murakami’s signature cheeky, anime-inspired motifs of flowers and skulls printed on unisex sneakers and tees for adults and toddlers. “For the past 10-plus years, without exaggeration, I have been wearing Vans slip-ons almost every single day,” he says. “For me, there are no other shoes that are so comfortably wearable that let me focus on producing my artwork.” Murakami also created skate decks (though they weren’t his first — and probably won’t be his last).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Takashi Murakami Has Been Wearing Vans for 10 Years', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-06-16T16:25:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Angela Koh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Angela', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Koh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/36cac210-f0f4-56df-8ca2-600e491f51e5', 'word_count': 121, 'uri': 'nyt://article/36cac210-f0f4-56df-8ca2-600e491f51e5'}, {'abstract': 'The annual forecast by the Congressional Budget Office showed a small drop, attributable to continued low interest rates, in the long-term outlook for debt levels.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/17/business/low-interest-rates-could-trim-government-debt-load-budget-office-says.html', 'snippet': 'The annual forecast by the Congressional Budget Office showed a small drop, attributable to continued low interest rates, in the long-term outlook for debt levels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — As large as the nation’s postrecession debt is, American taxpayers could catch a break for years to come from continued abnormally low interest rates, which hold down the cost of financing that debt and in turn limit the debt’s growth, congressional analysts said on Tuesday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Low Interest Rates Could Limit Growth of Federal Debt, Budget Office Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Budget Office Says U.S. Debt Is Being Muted by Low Rates', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Calmes, Jackie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interest Rates', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Congressional Budget Office', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-16T16:26:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jackie Calmes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jackie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Calmes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0e6f050e-ccb9-5797-b5f4-c622788554f3', 'word_count': 528, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0e6f050e-ccb9-5797-b5f4-c622788554f3'}, {'abstract': 'A statement sent out to reporters from the Democratic National Committee, welcoming Donald Trump to the 2016 presidential race, with just the slightest hint of sarcasm.', 'web