ps Essex Street and Bushwick’s Clearing. And of course there are the high-octane art dinners and parties: the trek out to the Foundation Beyeler, the salon between Tina Brown and Tino Sehgal followed by a feast at the Museum für Gegenwartskunst, Tolga Albayrak’s globetrotting art bash Tolga’s Fair Club and countless lavish nights at the city’s crown jewel, the Grand Hotel Trois Rois.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Larger-Than-Life Highlights of Art Basel’s Unlimited Sector', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ART BASEL (FESTIVAL)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ai Weiwei', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Balazs, Andre', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Tina', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McGinley, Ryan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sehgal, Tino', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Uecker, Gunther', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'von Bismarck, Julius', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Grand Hotel', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Basel (Switzerland)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-16T19:41:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Freeman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Freeman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9d9b9ea0-f672-5d53-9119-997d58499c9e', 'word_count': 498, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9d9b9ea0-f672-5d53-9119-997d58499c9e'}, {'abstract': 'The desi