hes seeking reform, was convicted of inciting hatred and insulting institutions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BAGHDAD — A court in Bahrain sentenced the leader of the country’s largest opposition movement to four years in prison on Tuesday, reflecting an escalating push by the government to silence dissident voices in the island kingdom.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bahrain Opposition Leader Sentenced to 4 Years in Prison', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'World Briefing | Middle East; Bahrain: Opposition Leader Sentenced', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fahim, Kareem', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bahrain', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Salman, Ali', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Wefaq National Islamic Society, Al-', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-17T01:36:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kareem Fahim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kareem', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fahim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/81287dc8-e520-5d35-9062-967926bf8b5b', 'word_count': 335, 'uri': 'nyt://article/81287dc8-e520-5d35-9062-967926bf8b5b'}, {'abstract': 'A remarkable political survivor, Mr. Demirel dominated his country’s affairs for almost 50 years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/17/world/europe/suleyman-demirel-former-prime-minister-of-turkey-dies-at-90.html', 'snippet': 'A remarkable political survivor, Mr. Demirel dominated his country’s affairs for almost 50 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Suleyman Demirel, who served seven times as Turkey’s prime minister, dominating the nation’s politics when the country struggled with violence, economic stagnation and military rule, died on Wednesday in Ankara, Turkey. He was 90.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/world/18demirel-1-obit/18demirel-1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/18/world/18demirel-1-obit/18demirel-1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/world/18demirel-1-obit/18demirel-1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/world/18demirel-1-obit/18demirel-1-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/world/18demirel-1-obit/18demirel-1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/18/world/18demirel-1-obit/18demirel-1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/world/18demirel-1-obit/18demirel-1-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Suleyman Demirel, Seven Times Turkey’s Prime Minister, Dies at 90', 'kicker': None