 {'abstract': 'The Chicago Blackhawks’ victory over the Tampa Bay Lightning to win the Stanley Cup was the third-most-watched Game 6 of the Cup finals on record.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/17/sports/hockey/hockey-delivers-viewers-for-nbc.html', 'snippet': 'The Chicago Blackhawks’ victory over the Tampa Bay Lightning to win the Stanley Cup was the third-most-watched Game 6 of the Cup finals on record.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Chicago Blackhawks’ 2-0 victory over the Tampa Bay Lightning to win the Stanley Cup on Monday was seen on NBC by an average of eight million viewers, making it the third-most-watched Game 6 of the Cup finals on record. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hockey Delivers Viewers for NBC', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | Broadcasting', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hockey Delivers Viewers for NBC', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stanley Cup', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chicago Blackhawks', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tampa Bay Lightning', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-17T03:35:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Sandomir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sandomir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/fcb6a889-f33d-5987-bcba-a0519e8fd5a9', 'word_count': 40, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fcb6a889-f33d-5987-bcba-a0519