difficult task when traveling to ISIS-occupied areas is impossible.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/times-insider/2015/06/17/how-the-times-covers-isis/', 'snippet': 'Ben Hubbard provides a look at what it is like to report on life with the Islamic State, a difficult task when traveling to ISIS-occupied areas is impossible.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The hardest part of writing about the Islamic State is that there is no way for us to go and check out anything ourselves. The group has killed many journalists it has gotten its hands on and is more interested in putting out its own message through videos and social media, which allows it to idealize itself and entice recruits.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/world/caliphate-web/caliphate-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/16/world/caliphate-web/caliphate-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/world/caliphate-web/caliphate-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/world/caliphate-web/caliphate-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/world/caliphate-web/caliphate-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/16/world/caliphate-web/caliphate-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/16/world/caliphate-web/caliphate-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How The Times Covers ISIS', 'kicker': 'Times Insider', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News Sources, Confidential Status of', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Propaganda', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Baghdad (Iraq)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Beirut (Lebanon)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Istanbul (Turkey)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-17T17:15:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Hubbard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hubbard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6f0481df-ac14-5b3f-8bf4-a6bf60211a8a', 'word_count': 539, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6f0481df-ac14-5b3f-8bf4-a6bf60211a8a'}, {'abstract': 'The limited edition is on sale at Art Basel and online.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/17/sara-cwynar-tote-bag-art-metropole/', 'snippet': 'The limited edition is on sale at Art Basel and online.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Among the stacks of miscellany packed into the multidisciplinary photographer Sara Cwynar’s studio is a selection of old trade manuals — including a 1960s or ’70s catalog for customizable shopping bags. “You would pick the kind of bag and the type to put on it,” she explains, “and there’s a simplicity to the imagery that doesn’t exist anymore,” she says of the book’s pages. Cwynar repurposed the images for a series of limited-edition canvas totes — the aptly named “Bags on Bags” — available in Art Metropole’s booth at Art Basel. True to form for an artist known for her vibrant works, she sold the Canadian institution on using four colors instead of two.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/17/t-magazine/17moss-cwynar/17moss-cwynar-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 487, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/17/t-magazine/17moss-cwynar/17moss-cwynar-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 487}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/17/t-magazine/17moss-cwynar/17moss-cwynar-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 831, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/17/t-magazine/17moss-cwynar/17moss-cwynar-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1208, 'width': 1489, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/17/t-magazine/17moss-cwynar/17moss-cwynar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/17/t-magazine/17moss-cwynar/17moss-cwynar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'r