 Here are a few noteworthy items to keep in mind for your next outdoor adventure.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/business/GADGET1/GADGET1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 368, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/18/business/GADGET1/GADGET1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 368}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/business/GADGET1/GADGET1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 627, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/business/GADGET1/GADGET1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1255, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/business/GADGET1/GADGET1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/18/business/GADGET1/GADGET1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/business/GADGET1/GADGET1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Devices Adapted to the Outdoor Life', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Adapted to the Wild', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electronics', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Camps and Camping', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hikes and Hiking', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'G-Technology Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Eton Corp', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Casio Computer Co', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goal Zero', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Monster Cable Products Inc', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-17T21:40:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gregory Schmidt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gregory', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schmidt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/513917dd-965b-59b9-b3b0-88cca60f5123', 'word_count': 749, 'uri': 'nyt://article/513917dd-965b-59b9-b3b0-88cca60f5123'}, {'abstract': 'Many authors on the global stage, like Dany Laferrière, claim multiple national allegiances regarding words and country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/18/books/academie-francaise-honor-highlights-fluid-national-allegiances-among-writers.html', 'snippet': 'Many authors on the global stage, like Dany Laferrière, claim multiple national allegiances regarding words and country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — When the Académie Française, the most august literary institution in France, inducted Dany Laferrière last month, it insisted that that Haitian-Québécois novelist was the first non-French citizen to enter its ranks. It turns out that is not quite the case. The Académie later acknowledged that a handful of others — including the Belgian-born Marguerite Yourcenar, the French-born American writer Julien Green and the Algerian-born novelist Assi