tion-plan/', 'snippet': 'Pro-democracy campaigners cheered its failure, while supporters of the Beijing-backed proposal vowed to use the defeat to campaign against pan-democratic lawmakers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hong Kong’s legislature voted down a plan on Thursday to change how the semiautonomous Chinese territory chooses its leader. The package would have allowed voters to directly elect Hong Kong’s top official in 2017, but pro-democracy politicians said the Chinese government-backed proposal placed too many controls on who could appear on the ballot.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/world/18sino-hongkong02/18sino-hongkong02-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/18/world/18sino-hongkong02/18sino-hongkong02-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/world/18sino-hongkong02/18sino-hongkong02-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/world/18sino-hongkong02/18sino-hongkong02-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/world/18sino-hongkong02/18sino-hongkong02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/18/world/18sino-hongkong02/18sino-hongkong02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 't