The main attraction of Ms. Benglis’s exhibition is a quartet of gorgeous fountains.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The most compelling temporary exhibition produced by the Storm King Art Center in recent years, “Lynda Benglis: Water Sources” focuses on a heretofore unfamiliar but important dimension of Ms. Benglis’s distinguished career: creating working fountains. The show’s main attraction is a quartet of gorgeous fountains rising from temporary, circular pools embedded in the lawn outside the center’s home building.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Lynda Benglis Celebrates the Fluidity of Nature at Storm King', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tapping Into the Fluidity of Nature', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Storm King Art Center', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Benglis, Lynda', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-18T20:12:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ken Johnson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Johnson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8a370f8-77d9-5b43-a5af-2ce097945f7d', 'word_count': 928, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8a370f8-77d9-5b43-a5af-2ce097945f7d'}, {'abstract': 'Waiting for a big secret to be revealed provides ample time for insights into a relationship with a guarded parent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/21/style/missing-a-father-i-hardly-knew.html', 'snippet': 'Waiting for a big secret to be revealed provides ample time for insights into a relationship with a guarded parent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The