g-to-them-is-a-hike.html', 'snippet': 'The Mountain Shows take musicians and listeners to the Hudson Highlands for performances staged along the Bull Hill trail.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE mountain looms large in the imagination of musicians. Whether it’s in Strauss’s “Alpine Symphony,” Led Zeppelin’s “Misty Mountain Hop” or spirituals like “Go Tell It on the Mountain,” it has long represented ambition and perseverance, or an escape from the mundane, a conquest blown to mythic proportions.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/arts/19MOUNTAINJP1/19MOUNTAINJP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/19/arts/19MOUNTAINJP1/19MOUNTAINJP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/arts/19MOUNTAINJP1/19MOUNTAINJP1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/arts/19MOUNTAINJP1/19MOUNTAINJP1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/arts/19MOUNTAINJP1/19MOUNTAINJP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/19/arts/19MOUNTAINJP1/19MOUNTAINJP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/arts/19MOUNTAINJP1/19MOUNTAINJP1-thumb