uz absent from camp, the Giants showed signs of becoming more comfortable with the offensive system implemented last season by Ben McAdoo.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/19/sports/football/giants-complete-minicamp-with-a-crisper-edge-to-west-coast-offense.html', 'snippet': 'Even with the injured star receivers Odell Beckham Jr. and Victor Cruz absent from camp, the Giants showed signs of becoming more comfortable with the offensive system implemented last season by Ben McAdoo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — When the Giants held their mandatory minicamp last June, their lack of familiarity with the West Coast offense being installed by the new coordinator Ben McAdoo was readily apparent. Play calls were met with confusion. Assignments were missed. Routes were run incorrectly. The out-of-sync quarterback Eli Manning misfired often.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/20/sports/19giants/19giants-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 444, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/20/sports/19giants/19giants-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 444}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/20/sports/19giants/19giants-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 757, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/20/sports/19giants/19giants-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1515, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/20/sports/19giants/19giants-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard'