mbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/multimedia/tribe-anatomy/tribe-anatomy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/multimedia/tribe-anatomy/tribe-anatomy-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1921, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/multimedia/tribe-anatomy/tribe-anatomy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/18/multimedia/tribe-anatomy/tribe-anatomy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/multimedia/tribe-anatomy/tribe-anatomy-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Anatomy of a Scene | ‘The Tribe’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Slaboshpytskiy, Myroslav', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Tribe (Movie)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-18T23:20:07+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/6871b779-ca16-53ce-972f-b1b06df43b34', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/6871b779-ca16-53ce-972f-b1b06df43b34'}, {'abstract': 'The director of “The Tribe” discusses a sequence from his film.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/19/movies/the-tribe-with-movie-trailer-myroslav-slaboshpytskiy-narrates-a-scene.html', 'snippet': 'The director of “The Tribe” discusses a sequence from his film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Words are not spoken aloud in “The Tribe,” but volumes are expressed in this Ukranian feature set at a school for the deaf. The film, from Myroslav Slaboshpytskiy, uses a nonprofessional cast that communicates in sign language. In this scene, a new student (Grigoriy Fesenko) participates in a fight organized by a gang he is set to join. The sequence happens in one unbroken take and fills the screen with extras and intricate fight choreography.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Myroslav Slaboshpytskiy Narrates a Scene From ‘The Tribe’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sign Language', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Slaboshpytskiy, Myroslav', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Tribe (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-18T23:21:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/92d9d4ad-de08-5f9f-95d1-6fe23f80a17e', 'word_count': 309, 'uri': 'nyt://article/92d9d4ad-de08-5f9f-95d1-6fe23f80a17e'}, {'abstract': 'The agreement would also prohibit guards’ striking prisoners in the head, put body cameras on guards and flag guards who repeatedly use force.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/19/nyregion/accord-near-on-sweeping-reforms-at-rikers-jail-including-us-monitor.html', 'snippet': 'The agreement would also prohibit guards’ striking prisoners in the head, put body cameras on guards and flag guards who repeatedly use force.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York City officials have tentatively agreed to sweeping reforms that would remake Rikers Island, including the appointment of a federal monitor to oversee the jail complex, explicit prohibitions against guards’ striking prisoners in the head and even the introduction of body cameras worn by guards.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/nyregion/19RIKERSjpy1/19RIKERSjpy1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 341, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/19/nyregion/19RIKERSjpy1/19RIKERSjpy1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 341}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/nyregion/19RIKERSjpy1/19RIKERSjpy1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 581, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/nyregion/19RIKERSjpy1/19RIKERSjpy1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1163, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/nyregion/19RIKERSjpy1/19RIKERSjpy1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/19/nyregion/19RIKERSjpy1/19RIKERSjpy1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/nyregion/19RIKERSjpy1/19RIKERSjpy1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Deal Is Near on Far-Reaching Reforms at Rikers, Including a Federal Monitor', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Deal Is Near on Far-Reaching Reforms at Rikers ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rikers Island Prison Complex', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bharara, Preet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prison Guards and Corrections Officers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-18T23:25:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Weiser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weiser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/03f43824-a7bf-5772-b9ed-9e56646fcfd3', 'word_count': 1593, 'uri': 'nyt://article/03f43824-a7bf-5772-b9ed-9e56646fcfd3'}, {'abstract': 'In Rick Famuyiwa’s film, Malcolm, a smart student and musician prepping for a Harvard interview, does a favor for a drug dealer and winds up with a gun and a backpack of contraband.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/19/movies/dope-a-teenage-comedy-plays-with-stereotypes.html', 'snippet': 'In Rick Famuyiwa’s film, Malcolm, a smart student and musician prepping for a Harvard interview, does a favor for a drug dealer and winds up with a gun and a backpack of contraband.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A coming-of-age story that is at once a parody of, and a tribute to, ’90s-vintage ghetto dramas, “Dope” wears its pop-culture obsessions on its sleeve. So does its hero, Malcolm (Shameik Moore), a teenager navigating his senior year of high school in a rough part of Los Angeles. And not only his sleeve: Malcolm’s whole look, from his high-top fade to his vintage Air Jordans, expresses a geeky commitment to hip-hop’s golden decade, which for him lasted from roughly 1988 until 2001 (that is, from “It Takes a Nation of Millions to Hold Us Back” to “The Blueprint.”)', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/arts/19DOPE/19DOPE-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 289, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/19/arts/19DOPE/19DOPE-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 289}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/arts/19DOPE/19DOPE-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 494, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/arts/19DOPE/19DOPE-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 988, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/arts/19DOPE/19DOPE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/19/arts/19DOPE/19DOPE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/arts/19DOPE/19DOPE-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subTyp