mmigrant-party-gains-in-denmark-elections.html', 'snippet': 'The far-right Danish People’s Party emerged in second place over all, raising questions about the role it could play in a new government.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In an election that turned on economic uncertainty and fierce debates over immigration, Danish voters on Thursday ousted their center-left government in a clear swing to the right that unexpectedly elevated an anti-immigrant, anti-European Union party that had been on the margins of the country’s politics. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Anti-Immigrant Party Gains in Denmark Elections', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Anti-Immigrant Party Makes Gains in Danish Vote ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eddy, Melissa', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Denmark', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Danish People's Party (1941-43)", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thorning-Schmidt, Helle', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Social Democratic Party (Denmark)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-19T01:09:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Eddy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eddy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/69192a8a-69a0-5878-a45b-c8476391804a', 'word_count': 688, 'uri': 'nyt://article/69192a8a-69a0-5878-a45b-c8476391804a'}, {'abstract': 'With New York about to become one of the states to allow legal marijuana, about 2,000 attendees came to a marijuana business exposition to network and to check out new products.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/19/business/at-cannabis-trade-show-vendors-tread-a-careful-line.html', 'snippet': 'With New York about to become one of the states to allow legal marijuana, about 2,000 attendees came to a marijuana business exposition to network and to check out new products.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A question hung in the air at the Cannabis World Congress and Business Exposition at the Jacob K. Javits Convention Center in Manhattan on Thursday: How do you show off your wares in a place where actually using them would be illegal?', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/business/19JP-CANNABIS/19JP-CANNABIS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/19/business/19JP-CANNABIS/19JP-CANNABIS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/business/19JP-CANNABIS/19JP-CANNABIS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/business/19JP-CANNABIS/19JP-CANNABIS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/business/19JP-CANNABIS/19JP-CANNABIS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/