ard With a Plan to Subsidize Broadband for the Poor ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Communications Commission', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Telephones and Telecommunications', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Inequality', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wheeler, Thomas E', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-19T03:05:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rebecca R. Ruiz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rebecca', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Ruiz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5c123674-d10a-5c8d-8979-e4d2978495bd', 'word_count': 520, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5c123674-d10a-5c8d-8979-e4d2978495bd'}, {'abstract': 'Woods shot an 80, his worst score in a United States Open, as part of a threesome that was a combined 28 over at Chambers Bay.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/19/sports/golf/us-open-2015-tiger-woods-sees-another-round-slip-away.html', 'snippet': 'Woods shot an 80, his worst score in a United States Open, as part of a threesome that was a combined 28 over at Chambers Bay.', 'lead_paragraph': 'UNIVERSITY PLACE, Wash. — On the first morning of the United States Open, Henrik Stenson and Dustin Johnson charted the course for the great unknown that was Chambers Bay with matching five-under-par 65s. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/19/sports/subGOLFPIX1/subGOLFPIX1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_na