, 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0754d4c2-cf9f-5f57-8566-1732adcdfb25', 'word_count': 305, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0754d4c2-cf9f-5f57-8566-1732adcdfb25'}, {'abstract': 'A new report from America’s top science advisory panel identifies ways to price flood insurance more realistically. Will politicians listen?', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/19/science-panel-tries-to-reinject-reality-into-flood-insurance-pricing/', 'snippet': 'A new report from America’s top science advisory panel identifies ways to price flood insurance more realistically. Will politicians listen?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Federal flood insurance in the United States is a mess, with politics continuing to trump data, and taxpayers paying the price.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/nyregion/JP-INSURANCE1/JP-INSURANCE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/13/nyregion/JP-INSURANCE1/JP-INSURANCE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/nyregion/JP-INSURANCE1/JP-INSURANCE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 642, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/nyregion/JP-INSURANCE1/JP-INSURANCE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1285, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/nyregion/JP-INSURANCE1/JP-INSURANCE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'widt