ach-2-a-return-to-sun-and-bubble-gum.html', 'snippet': 'The story of two young couples from different eras continues in this movie musical sequel.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Their endless summer has ended. In “Teen Beach 2” (Friday, 8 p.m. Eastern), the sequel to the 2013 Disney Channel smash musical, it’s been three months since Mack (Maia Mitchell) and Brady (Ross Lynch) surfed 50 years into the past and onto the set of “Wet Side Story.” But in real life, the only epic wave is the one drowning their love. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/arts/21GUIDE5/21GUIDE5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/21/arts/21GUIDE5/21GUIDE5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/arts/21GUIDE5/21GUIDE5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 746, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/arts/21GUIDE5/21GUIDE5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1492, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/arts/21GUIDE5/21GUIDE5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/21/arts/21GUIDE5/21GUIDE5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/arts/21GUIDE5/21GUIDE5-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'th