web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/21/theater/amazing-grace-a-musical-about-slavery-to-begin-previews.html', 'snippet': '“Hamilton” isn’t the only new historical epic musical opening on Broadway this summer.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Hamilton” isn’t the only new historical epic musical opening on Broadway this summer. With far less fanfare but large ambitions, not to mention budget ($16 million), “Amazing Grace” tries to tell an overtly religious story about America’s original sin through a portrait of John Newton, an 18th- and 19th-century slave trader turned abolitionist who wrote the well-known hymn named in the title. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/arts/21GUIDE4/21GUIDE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 895, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/21/arts/21GUIDE4/21GUIDE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 895}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/arts/21GUIDE4/21GUIDE4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 687, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/arts/21GUIDE4/21GUIDE4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1373, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/arts/21GUIDE4/21GUIDE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/21/arts/21GUIDE4/21GUIDE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None,