, 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'West Bank', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hamas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Israeli Settlements', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-19T17:59:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Diaa Hadid', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Diaa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hadid', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0f1adb8f-609b-5993-810c-1e33d949fe8e', 'word_count': 488, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0f1adb8f-609b-5993-810c-1e33d949fe8e'}, {'abstract': 'The musician and star of “The Overnight” recommends his most beloved stores, people, films and more.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/19/jason-schwartzman-inspirations/', 'snippet': 'The musician and star of “The Overnight” recommends his most beloved stores, people, films and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Jason Schwartzman begins the conversation by announcing, “I’m a big fan of recommendations and lists,” it turns out that the 25 things he has chosen to discuss are only a tiny fraction of the potential recommendations he’s generated. (We whittled it down to 15.) Perhaps that shouldn’t be a surprise, coming from a musician and actor who has formed a longstanding cinematic collaboration with noted obsessive Wes Anderson. Schwartzman’s recommendations, in turn, serve as jumping-off points for more general discussions about social networks (the real-life ones, not websites and apps), aesthetic influences and finding lifelong friends through shared cultural interests. “My idea of fun is browsing,” he admits. To that end, he has cultivated an extensive network of recommenders; it is pretty rare to hear an actor mention that he’s become friends with a film critic.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jason Schwartzman Shares a Few of His Many — and We Mean Many — Inspirations', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ANDERSON, WES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brice, Patrick (Film Director)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schilling, Taylor', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schwartzman, Jason', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scott, Adam (1973- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Overnight (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-19T18:00:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ken Miller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Miller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/834da9de-5de1-5624-84c5-0dd7dc1b53ed', 'word_count': 170, 'uri': 'nyt://article/834da9de-5de1-5624-84c5-0dd7dc1b53ed'}, {'abstract': 'The musician and star of “The Overnight” recommends his most beloved stores, people, films and more.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/19/jason-schwartzman-inspirations/', 'snippet': 'The musician and star of “The Overnight” recommends his most beloved stores, people, films and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Jason Schwartzman begins the conversation by announcing, “I’m a big fan of recommendations and lists,” it turns out that the 25 things he has chosen to discuss are only a tiny fraction of the potential recommendations he’s generated. (We whittled it down to 15.) Perhaps that shouldn’t be a surpris