s://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/21/nyregion/a-street-nun-who-specializes-in-redemption.html', 'snippet': 'Ana Martinez de Luco, 60, a Catholic nun, can be found in the thick of the action at a bustling can and bottle recycling center in Brooklyn.', 'lead_paragraph': '“They call me the street nun,” said Ana Martinez de Luco, 60, a Catholic nun who does not wear a habit or robes, but rather a green apron and sandals and can be found in the thick of the action in the shantytown that is Sure We Can, a bustling can and bottle redemption center in a lot on McKibbin Street in East Williamsburg, Brooklyn.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/nyregion/21CHARACTERSUB/21CHARACTERSUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/21/nyregion/21CHARACTERSUB/21CHARACTERSUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/nyregion/21CHARACTERSUB/21CHARACTERSUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/nyregion/21CHARACTERSUB/21CHARACTERSUB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/nyregion/21CHARACTERSUB/21CHARACTERSUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/21/nyregion/21CHARACTERSUB/21CHARACTERSUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank'