MassBliss Arts and Awareness Experience is running July 10 to 12 in the Berkshires in Massachusetts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/21/travel/spiritual-healing-and-arts-festival-in-the-berkshires.html', 'snippet': 'The inaugural MassBliss Arts and Awareness Experience is running July 10 to 12 in the Berkshires in Massachusetts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The inaugural MassBliss Arts and Awareness Experience, running July 10 to 12 in the Berkshires in Massachusetts, bills itself as a spiritual healing and arts festival. Peace Poets, a spoken-word hip-hop group, and the Bread and Puppet Theater will be on stage, and there will be a class on Ethiopian music, and one for those interested in extending their voice range.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/travel/21HORIZON/21HORIZON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/21/travel/21HORIZON/21HORIZON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/travel/21HORIZON/21HORIZON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/travel/21HORIZON/21HORIZON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 852, 'width': 1279, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/travel/21HORIZON/21HORIZON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/21/travel/21HORIZON/21HORIZON-thumbStandard.