f-chain-saws-cuts-clean-through-central-parks-calm.html', 'snippet': 'Central Park hosted a daylong contest to determine the best lumberjack in the United States, at least for this year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Typically, an orchestra comprising cellists and violinists might play Mozart at the Naumburg Bandshell, a neoclassical concert stage near 72nd Street in Central Park built in 1923 to stimulate the public’s interest in classical music. Instead, on Saturday, tall, bearded, thick-necked men hacked at pine logs with axes and chain saws.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Symphony of Chain Saws Cuts Clean Through Central Park’s Calm', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Symphony of Chain Saws Cuts Clean Through Central Park&#8217;s Calm', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Atkins, Hunter', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Logging Industry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Athletics and Sports', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Central Park (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Parks and Recreation Department (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-20T23:36:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hunter Atkins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hunter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Atkins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/638a9c63-8299-556d-a7d3-b87381dd9353', 'word_count': 927, 'uri': 'nyt://article/638a9c63-8299-556d-a7d3-b87381dd9353'}, {'abstract': 'The number of veterans on waiting lists of one month or more is now 50 percent higher than it was during the height of last year’s problems.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/21/us/wait-lists-grow-as-many-more-veterans-seek-care-and-funding-falls-far-short.html', 'snippet': 'The number of veterans on waiting lists of one month or more is now 50 percent higher than it was during the height of last year’s problems.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One year after outrage about long waiting lists for health care shook the Department of Veterans Affairs, the agency is facing a new crisis: The number of veterans on waiting lists of one month or more is now 50 percent higher than it was during the height of last year’s problems, department officials say. The department is also facing a nearly $3 billion budget shortfall, which could affect care for many veterans.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/us/21veterans/21veterans-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/21/us/21veterans/21veterans-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/us/21veterans/21veterans-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/us/21veterans/21veterans-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/us/21veterans/21veterans-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/21/us/21veterans/21veterans-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwi