llow Sweet Briar College, a women’s school in Virginia, to remain open for at least another year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Sweet Briar College, the women’s liberal arts college in rural Virginia that announced it would close in August — setting off a storm of protest and lawsuits from students, faculty and alumnae — will remain open for at least another academic year under an agreement announced Saturday by the attorney general of Virginia.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sweet Briar Reaches Deal to Stay Open', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sweet Briar Reaches Deal to Stay Open', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shutdowns (Institutional)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Virginia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sweet Briar College', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-21T02:16:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sheryl Gay Stolberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sheryl', 'middlename': 'Gay', 'lastname': 'Stolberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7804a45d-5c90-5d6d-ba0a-a2cf02eafed8', 'word_count': 822, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7804a45d-5c90-5d6d-ba0a-a2cf02eafed8'}, {'abstract': 'Going into the final day of the United States Open, the top 14 golfers included two major winners and several others who may be the best players never to have won one.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/21/sports/golf/lead-group-has-star-potential.html', 'snippet': 'Going into the final day of the United States Open, the top 14 golfers included two major winners and several others who may be the best players never to have won one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'UNIVERSITY PLACE, Wash. — It is initially overwhelming, but the more you play it, the less intimidating and more accessible it seems, the former United States Open champion Jim Furyk said. He was talking about Chambers Bay, which measured 7,637 yards on Saturday, but he could have been speaking of the PGA Tour.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/sports/CROUSE/CROUSE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 367, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/21/sports/CROUSE/CROUSE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 367}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/sports/CROUSE/CROUSE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 627, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/sports/CROUSE/CROUSE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1253, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/sports/CROUSE/CROUSE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/21/sports/CROUSE/CROUSE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/21/sports/CROUSE/CROUSE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'leg