uri': 'nyt://slideshow/d7813542-9a46-5fac-9249-67c4fbb8538b'}, {'abstract': 'The Clinton Correctional Facility had in recent years left some security posts unfilled and seen lapses in routine security procedures, current and former officials say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/22/nyregion/new-york-prison-escape-an-array-of-oversights-set-the-stage.html', 'snippet': 'The Clinton Correctional Facility had in recent years left some security posts unfilled and seen lapses in routine security procedures, current and former officials say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DANNEMORA, N.Y. — By the time David Sweat and Richard W. Matt engineered their extraordinary escape from the maximum-security prison here, corrections officers were rarely shining lights over the faces of inmates during hourly bed checks, making it hard to know whether a living, breathing person was inside a cell.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/nyregion/22MANHUNT4web/22MANHUNT4web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/22/nyregion/22MANHUNT4web/22MANHUNT4web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/nyregion/22MANHUNT4web/22MANHUNT4web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/nyregion/22MANHUNT4web/22MANHUNT4web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/nyregion/22MANHUNT4web/22MANHUNT4web-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/22/nyregion/22MANHUNT4web/22MANHUNT4web-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/nyregion/22MANHUNT4web/22MANHUNT4web-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lapses at Prison May Have Aided Killers’ Escape', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lapses at Prison May Have Aided Killers’ Escape', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prison Escapes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Winerip, Michael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Clinton Correctional Facility', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Matt, Richard W (1967- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sweat, David P (1980- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Dannemora (NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-21T12:36:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Winerip, Michael Schwirtz and Vivian Yee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Winerip', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schwirtz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Vivian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/498e8953-78cb-5f5a-a38c-f4bb6b99926b', 'word_count': 1853, 'uri': 'nyt://article/498e8953-78cb-5f5a-a38c-f4bb6b99926b'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Seizing a last chance to flee from the advancing German Army.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/21/1940-american-refugees-arrive-home/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Seizing a last chance to flee from the advancing German Army.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The United States liner Washington, ‘‘last chance’’ ship for Americans fleeing the war zone, arrived at 10:30 a.m. yesterday with 1,793 men, women and children, most of whom had passed fifteen long and harrowing minutes in lifeboats dangling over the liner’s side when the ship was threatened by a submarine June 11 off the northern coast of Portugal. To many, the submarine episode was less frightful than the ordeals they suffered while fleeing across Belgium and France, hardly a jump ahead of the German Army.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/blogs/22iht-old-1940/22iht-old-1940-articleLarge-v4.png', 'height': 470, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/22/blogs/22iht-old-1940/22iht-old-1940-articleLarge-v4.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 470}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/blogs/22iht-old-1940/22iht-old-1940-jumbo-v4.png', 'height': 803, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/blogs/22iht-old-1940/22iht-old-1940-superJumbo-v4.png', 'height': 1179, 'width': 1504, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'capt