er last week’s massacre in South Carolina.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/22/nyregion/a-show-of-solidarity-in-harlem-churches-after-charleston-killings.html', 'snippet': 'Pastors spoke of hatred and offered hope on Sunday as worshipers felt compelled to attend services after last week’s massacre in South Carolina.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The hurt could be felt in the solemnity of Sunday sermons and read on the faces of those seated in the pews for the first services in New York City since a white gunman killed nine black churchgoers last week during a Bible study in Charleston, S.C.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Show of Solidarity in Harlem Churches After Charleston Killings', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABYSSINIAN BAPTIST CHURCH', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AFRICAN METHODIST EPISCOPAL CHURCH', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'First Corinthian Baptist Church (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Harlem (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-21T23:24:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. David Goodman and Colleen Wright', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Colleen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wright', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ed14bba7-c30c-5f91-93c4-ff6678d8f841', 'word_count': 561, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ed14bba7-c30c-5f91-93c4-ff6678d8f841'}, {'abstract': 'Dr. Li helped show a skeptical medical establishment that a dominant gene, passed from parent to child, was predisposing family members to various cancers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/22/health/frederick-p-li-who-proved-a-genetic-cancer-link-dies-at-75.html', 'snippet': 'Dr. Li helped show a skeptical medical establishment that a dominant gene, passed from parent to child, was predisposing family members to various cancers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dr. Frederick P. Li, who helped prove to a doubting medical establishment that heredity and genetics play a major role in some forms of cancer, died on June 12 at his home in Brookline, Mass. He was 75.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/us/22Li-obit/22Li-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 853, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/22/us/22Li-obit/22Li-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 853}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/us/22Li-obit/22Li-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 720, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/us/22Li-obit/22Li-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1509, 'width': 1061, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/us/22Li-obit/22Li-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/22/us/22Li-obit/22Li-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'ran