uge.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/22/arts/dance/colette-marchand-glamorous-international-ballet-star-dies-at-90.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Marchand played a highly visible role in the postwar creative ferment of French ballet and she was nominated for an Oscar for her role in John Huston’s “Moulin Rouge.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Colette Marchand, a French ballerina whose long-legged glamour made her an international star in Roland Petit’s ballets in the 1940s and 1950s, and who was nominated for an Oscar for her role in John Huston’s “Moulin Rouge,” died on June 5 at her home in Bois-le-Roi, France. She was 90.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/arts/22Marchand-obit/22Marchand-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 870, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/22/arts/22Marchand-obit/22Marchand-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 870}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/arts/22Marchand-obit/22Marchand-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 706, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/arts/22Marchand-obit/22Marchand-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2044, 'width': 1409, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/arts/22Marchand-obit/22Marchand-obit-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/22/arts/22Marchand-obit/22Marchand-obit-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnai