t individual. Behind him lies a vicious movement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MONTGOMERY, Ala. — A VARIETY of clues to the motives of Dylann Storm Roof, the suspect in last week’s mass shooting at Emanuel African Methodist Episcopal Church in Charleston, S.C., have emerged. First, we saw the patches he wore on his jacket in a Facebook photo: the flags of regimes in South Africa and Rhodesia that brutally enforced white minority rule.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'White Supremacists Without Borders', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributors', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Racists Without Borders', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dees, Morris', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cohen, J Richard', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Charleston (SC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roof, Dylann Storm', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fringe Groups and Movements', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Charleston, SC, Shooting (2015)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hate Crimes', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-22T07:21:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Morris Dees and J. Richard Cohen', 'person'