.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/23/sports/golf/fox-and-greg-norman-have-a-rough-debut-at-the-us-open.html', 'snippet': 'Greg Norman, in his first United States Open as the lead analyst, was only a symptom of Fox’s poor debut as the event’s broadcaster, a role that will last 11 more years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Greg Norman, it was a moment to define himself in his first United States Open as the lead analyst. Dustin Johnson was on the 18th green on Sunday with a chance to win if he sank an eagle putt. What was Norman’s assessment of the putt? Would it go left or right? What sort of speed should he put on it? Norman said nothing. Johnson missed.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/sports/23TVSPORTSweb/23TVSPORTSweb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 374, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/23/sports/23TVSPORTSweb/23TVSPORTSweb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 374}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/sports/23TVSPORTSweb/23TVSPORTSweb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 639, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/sports/23TVSPORTSweb/23TVSPORTSweb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1277, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/sports/23TVSPORTSweb/23TVSPORTSweb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/23/sports/23TVSPORTSweb/23TVSPORTSweb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbna