 and trafficking networks in the south central Mediterranean. The operation, Eunavfor Med, based in Rome, also calls for the capture and destruction of the ships used by traffickers. Those phases, however, will require a United Nations Security Council resolution and the consent of the Libyan authorities.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'E.U. Begins Naval Operation in Mediterranean to Stop Trafficking of Migrants', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smuggling', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mediterranean Sea', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Trafficking', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-22T20:23:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabetta Povoledo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabetta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Povoledo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc80d21a-b505-5577-a99a-202c4aae0729', 'word_count': 144, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc80d21a-b505-5577-a99a-202c4aae0729'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Anderson, who oversaw the New Jersey city’s troubled public school system, had feuded openly with the mayor, teachers and many parents.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/23/nyregion/newark-schools-superintendent-is-stepping-down.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Anderson, who oversaw the New Jersey city’s troubled public school system, had feuded openly with the mayor, teachers and many parents.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cami Anderson, the superintendent of the Newar