}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/c113a4ad-4833-5dc8-bd49-1b858cfe76af', 'word_count': 927, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c113a4ad-4833-5dc8-bd49-1b858cfe76af'}, {'abstract': 'At Los Amigos Fishing and Hunting Club, dominoes have replaced softball and outdoor expeditions, but some members bear the scars of knifings and shootings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/23/nyregion/holdouts-from-rougher-era-endure-at-lower-east-side-club.html', 'snippet': 'At Los Amigos Fishing and Hunting Club, dominoes have replaced softball and outdoor expeditions, but some members bear the scars of knifings and shootings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Despite its name, Los Amigos Fishing and Hunting Club, with headquarters in a disheveled storefront on a still-gritty corner of the Lower East Side of Manhattan, had not seen a gun in nearly a decade — the club’s upstate deer hunting trips and fishing expeditions forgone long ago as its members aged into their 60s, 70s and 80s. Tracking bucks had given way to pastimes no more vigorous than dominoes as the club slipped into its sixth decade on Rivington Street.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/nyregion/00amigos-web1/00amigos-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/12/nyregion/00amigos-web1/00amigos-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/nyregion/00amigos-web1/00amigos-web1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/12/nyregion/00amigos-web1/00amigos-web1-su