nd now sits on Roosevelt Island.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No one, it seems, had been actively looking for it. Still, the disappearance of a lamppost that had sat at the Manhattan entrance to the Queensboro Bridge for decades had been somewhat of a local mystery.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/nyregion/23LAMPPOST1/23LAMPPOST1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 896, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/23/nyregion/23LAMPPOST1/23LAMPPOST1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 896}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/nyregion/23LAMPPOST1/23LAMPPOST1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 686, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/nyregion/23LAMPPOST1/23LAMPPOST1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1372, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/nyregion/23LAMPPOST1/23LAMPPOST1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/23/nyregion/23LAMPPOST1/23LAMPPOST1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/nyregion/23LAMPPOST1/23LAMPPOST1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Mystery of a Long-Missing Relic Is Solved and Returned to the Public  ', 'kicker': None, 'content_k