lion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/23/sports/golf/final-round-viewership.html', 'snippet': 'The U.S. Open audience peaked at 11.2 million and averaged 6.7 million.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The United States Open’s final round on Sunday was seen by an average of 6.7 million viewers on Fox. The audience peaked at 11.2 million from 10 to 10:30 p.m. Eastern. The Sunday viewership fell from a 9.6 million average the last time the Open was held in the Pacific time zone, in 2012, but last year’s Open in Pinehurst, N.C., had only a 4.6 million average. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Final-Round Viewership', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | Golf', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Final-Round Viewership', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ratings (Audience Measurement)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fox Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Golf)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-23T04:00:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Sandomir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sandomir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/a8cc8b99-96b5-5ba2-9f6b-95c6917160aa', 'word_count': 67, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a8cc8b99-96b5-5ba2-9f6b-95c6917160aa'}, {'abstract': 'Significant declines in the proportion of uninsured Americans are documented as the Supreme Court nears a ruling on Affordable Care Act subsidies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/23/us/fewer-poor-uninsured-study-finds-in-health-law.html'