, '_id': 'nyt://article/3c6cec49-678f-5a96-a6b2-71b784232e82', 'word_count': 593, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c6cec49-678f-5a96-a6b2-71b784232e82'}, {'abstract': 'Julia Preston tells of the hearing that got her started on her widely read article about Disney laying off 250 people this year. Days after the article appeared, a more recent round of layoffs scheduled by the company was reversed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/times-insider/2015/06/23/disney-has-no-comment-on-the-recent-reversal-of-layoffs/', 'snippet': 'Julia Preston tells of the hearing that got her started on her widely read article about Disney laying off 250 people this year. Days after the article appeared, a more recent round of layoffs scheduled by the company was reversed.', 'lead_paragraph': ' I have been covering the immigration beat for The New York Times for nine years, so I sensed that my recent story about layoffs of technology employees at Walt Disney World would draw our readers’ interest. The employees had been replaced by temporary immigrants, mainly from India, brought in by an outsourcing company, and the laid-off workers had to train the new ones in order to receive a severance.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/blogs/disney-jobs/disney-jobs-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/22/blogs/disney-jobs/disney-jobs-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/blogs/disney-jobs/disney-jobs-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 646, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/blogs/disney-jobs/disney-jobs-superJumbo.jpg', 'h