nyt://article/bd518389-2028-59a3-abba-1cbc1ed15224'}, {'abstract': 'A presidential power grab has jeopardized the modest gains the country made as a regional player in Africa.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/24/opinion/burundis-bit-part-politics.html', 'snippet': 'A presidential power grab has jeopardized the modest gains the country made as a regional player in Africa.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NAIROBI, Kenya — As I thought about the recent violence in the Central African nation of Burundi, I recalled a trip I made there three years ago. I realized that something I’d seen in 2012 was a key to why the coup attempt in May by a group of army officers had failed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/opinion/23onyangoart/23onyangoart-articleLarge.png', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/23/opinion/23onyangoart/23onyangoart-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/opinion/23onyangoart/23onyangoart-jumbo.png', 'height': 675, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/opinion/23onyangoart/23onyangoart-superJumbo.png', 'height': 675, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/opinion/23onyangoart/23onyangoart-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/23/opinion/23onyangoart/23onyangoart-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'r