l', 'snippet': 'Military training exercises this month in Latvia, a former Soviet republic, underline the seismic shift for an alliance that had been focused on threats far beyond its borders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAMP ADAZI, Latvia — After years of facing threats far beyond its borders, NATO is now reinvigorating plans to confront a much larger and more aggressive threat from its past: Moscow.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'NATO Refocuses on the Kremlin, Its Original Foe', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'NATO Refocuses on the Kremlin, Its Original Foe', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'North Atlantic Treaty Organization', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schmitt, Eric', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Latvia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Eastern Europe', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lithuania', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Estonia', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-23T11:00:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Schmitt and Steven Lee Myers', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schmitt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': 'Lee', 'lastname': 'Myers', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fff6801c-e095-5fbf-9d60-ef909955845c', 'word_count': 2493, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fff6801c-e095-5fbf-9d60-ef909955845c'}, {'abstract': 'Therapy is rife with difficult goodbyes. But this was the hardest.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/23/the-patient-i-abandoned/', 'snippet': 'Therapy is rife with difficult goodbyes. But this was the hardest.', 'lead_paragraph': 'John was 7 when I met him, and dealing with more than any child could be expected to endure. For the first years of his life, he had been witness to his father’s alcoholic binges, which often involved shouting, breaking objects and hitting John and his mother. His mother struggled too, with depression and a crack addiction. When John was 5, the state’s Child Protective Services removed him from the home and placed him in a series of foster-care arrangements. Although his father disappeared, never to be heard from again, his mother underwent court-mandated substance-abuse treatment and was later allowed to see John in supervised visits. Eventually, she regained custody — which was right before he and I met.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/04/opinion/opinionator-pog-couch/opinionator-pog-couch-articleLarge.png', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/11/04/opinion/opinionator-pog-couch/opinionator-pog-couch-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/04/opinion/opinionator-pog-couch/opinionator-pog-couch-jumbo.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/04/opinion/opinionator-pog-couch/opinionator-pog-couch-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'su