derate-flag/', 'snippet': 'The conversation after the shooting in Charleston, S.C., almost immediately turned to the Confederate flag, which the gunman embraced in online postings and which hung at the state’s Capitol. On Monday, Gov. Nikki R. Haley called for it to come do...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good Tuesday morning from Washington. The conversation after the shooting in Charleston, S.C., almost immediately turned to the Confederate flag, which the gunman embraced in online postings and which hung at the state’s Capitol. On Monday, Gov. Nikki R. Haley called for it to come down.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/us/politics/23firstdraft-newsletter/23firstdraft-newsletter-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/23/us/politics/23firstdraft-newsletter/23firstdraft-newsletter-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/us/politics/23firstdraft-newsletter/23firstdraft-newsletter-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/us/politics/23firstdraft-newsletter/23firstdraft-newsletter-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/us/politics/23firstdraft-newsletter/23firstdraft-newsletter-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/23/us/politics/23firstdraft-newsletter/23firstdraft-newsletter-thu