ate battle flag has special meaning. While the old flag remains embedded in the state’s flag, some are hoping that could soon change.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The bipartisan push to remove the Confederate battle flag from South Carolina’s State House building resonated across the United States, but in Mississippi it had special meaning.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/us/politics/23firstdraft-mississippi/23firstdraft-mississippi-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 434, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/23/us/politics/23firstdraft-mississippi/23firstdraft-mississippi-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 434}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/us/politics/23firstdraft-mississippi/23firstdraft-mississippi-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 741, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/us/politics/23firstdraft-mississippi/23firstdraft-mississippi-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1442, 'width': 1992, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/us/politics/23firstdraft-mississippi/23firstdraft-mississippi-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/23/us/politics/23firstdraft-mississippi/23firstdraft-mississippi-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/us/politics/23firstdraft-mississippi/23firstdraft-mississippi-th