 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/73bc4a27-6d39-59d1-9c53-db090637ef0f', 'word_count': 723, 'uri': 'nyt://article/73bc4a27-6d39-59d1-9c53-db090637ef0f'}, {'abstract': 'In South Carolina, newspapers boldly said the time had come to take down the Confederate flag, but the feeling was not shared across the South.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/23/us/southern-newspaper-front-pages-reflect-shifting-politics-around-a-confederate-flag.html', 'snippet': 'In South Carolina, newspapers boldly said the time had come to take down the Confederate flag, but the feeling was not shared across the South.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Throughout South Carolina, newspapers treated Gov. Nikki Haley’s call to remove the Confederate battle flag from the grounds of the State House — a seismic shift in that state’s politics — as huge news.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/blogs/23PAPERS-state/23PAPERS-state-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 493, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/blogs/23PAPERS-state/23PAPERS-state-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1230, 'width': 591, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/blogs/23PAPERS-state/23PAPERS-state-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/23/blogs/23PAPERS-state/23PAPERS-state-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/23/blogs/23PAPERS-state/23PAPERS-state-thumbLarge.jpg', 'hei