', 'snippet': 'To help us better visualize the mysterious triangle offense, we turned to Joshua Walsh, the artist whose work defined the first season of HBO’s True Detective.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The deeper we went on the triangle offense, the more we felt as if we were inside some sort of antechamber of the “True Detective” Carcosa lair. So we tracked down Joshua Walsh, the artist whose work defined the first season of that HBO show, and invited him to contemplate the many mysteries of the triangle. What he came up with is a series of clocks based on the principles outlined in Tex Winter’s book, “The Triple-Post Offense.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/sports/21clocks-web/21clocks-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/18/sports/21clocks-web/21clocks-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/sports/21clocks-web/21clocks-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/sports/21clocks-web/21clocks-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/18/sports/21clocks-web/21clocks-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/18/sports/21clocks-web/21clocks-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, '