/music/review-poliuto-a-rare-donizetti-bel-canto-thriller.html', 'snippet': 'This tale of religious persecution and martyrdom in Roman-occupied Armenia gets an updated staging at the Glyndebourne Festival.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LEWES, England — On a sunny day at the Glyndebourne Festival here, an hour’s train ride from London, bees buzz amiably through wildflowers, sheep bleat in the open pasture, and champagne glasses clink amid high-society chatter. Only the croquet lawn is safe from picnic tables, as patrons claim preferred spots early in the afternoon. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/24/arts/24POLIUTO/24POLIUTO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/24/arts/24POLIUTO/24POLIUTO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/24/arts/24POLIUTO/24POLIUTO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/24/arts/24POLIUTO/24POLIUTO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/24/arts/24POLIUTO/24POLIUTO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/24/arts/24POLIUTO/24POLIUTO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/24/arts/24POLIUTO/24