 a dozen people were killed in the Xinjiang region of far western China this week in a clash between ethnic Uighurs and the police, according to a report by Radio Free Asia that was largely corroborated by local residents, including a police officer.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Deadly Clash Between Police and Ethnic Uighurs Reported in Xinjiang Region of China', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Deadly Clash in Western China Between Uighurs and the Police', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Uighurs (Chinese Ethnic Group)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Forsythe, Michael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kashgar (China)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Attacks on Police', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Xinjiang (China)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-24T08:30:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Forsythe', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Forsythe', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/41b667dc-ae8c-5fc5-864d-efc66ea7485d', 'word_count': 494, 'uri': 'nyt://article/41b667dc-ae8c-5fc5-864d-efc66ea7485d'}, {'abstract': 'Merrick’s cachet is growing among young couples from the city, former residents returning home and motorboat enthusiasts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/28/realestate/merrick-ny-a-hamlet-with-a-nautical-flavor.html', 'snippet': 'Merrick’s cachet is growing among young couples from the city, former residents returning home and motorboat enthusiasts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Vanessa and Aaron Kopelowitz were living in a 600-square-foot, one-bedroom apartment in Manhattan and expecting their first child when they started doing some “serious house hunting” on Long Island about three years ago. They hoped to buy on the North Shore, but were turned off by the drive from Manhattan to Port Washington and the train ride to Syosset. They headed south.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Merrick, N.Y., a Hamlet With a Nautical Flavor', 'kicker': 'Living In', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hamlet With a Nautical Flavor', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fischler, Marcelle Sussman', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Merrick (NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-24T08:59:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marcelle Sussman Fischler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marcelle', 'middlename': 'Sussman', 'lastname': 'Fischler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5b246039-3017-59c7-a121-5278577ba47d', 'word_count': 1283, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5b246039-3017-59c7-a121-5278577ba47d'}, {'abstract': 'South America’s 99-year-old soccer championship has been a chance for advocates to press issues facing the Mapuches before an international audience.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/25/sports/soccer/indigenous-group-plants-its-flag-in-copa-america.html', 'snippet': 'South America’s 99-year-old soccer championship has been a chance for advocates to press issues facing the Mapuches before an international audience.', 'le