ternational Herald Tribune archives: A Rush of Recruits on Lord Kitchener’s Birthday in 1915.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/24/1915-rush-of-recruits-on-lord-kitcheners-birthday/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: A Rush of Recruits on Lord Kitchener’s Birthday in 1915.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Lord Kitchener’s sixty-fifth birthday was celebrated today throughout the United Kingdom and the British Empire by a rush of recruits to ‘‘K. of K’s Army.’’ The Minister of War, who received hundreds of cables and telegrams, not only from his own countrymen but from ‘‘kin beyond the sea,’’ in the United States, expressed himself as deeply touched, but the reports from the recruiting stations, which told of thousands joining the colors to make the day memorable, were, he said, the finest tribute he had ever received. — The New York Herald, European Edition, June 25, 1915', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/blogs/25iht-oldjune25-kitchener/25iht-oldjune25-kitchener-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 362, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/25/blogs/25iht-oldjune25-kitchener/25iht-oldjune25-kitchener-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 362}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/blogs/25iht-oldjune25-kitchener/25iht-oldjune25-kitchener-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 363, 'width': 602, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/blogs/25iht-oldjune25-kitchener/25iht-oldjune25-kitchener-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 363, 'width': 602, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnai