tizens in New York State are on the lookout for two escaped killers. When do two men become one too many?', 'lead_paragraph': 'They cut holes in the backs of their cells together. They crept through prison crawl spaces together, burrowed through a pipe and climbed out of a manhole together. Disappeared together.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Weighing the Pros and Cons for 2 Escaped Convicts to Remain Partners in Crime', 'kicker': 'Crime Scene', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Escapees May Find Strength in Numbers, or That Two Can Be One Too Many ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prison Escapes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Michael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Matt, Richard W (1967- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sweat, David P (1980- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fugitives', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Clinton Correctional Facility', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-24T18:57:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Wilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/caa25a18-0209-5594-9ae2-c616cf743774', 'word_count': 806, 'uri': 'nyt://article/caa25a18-0209-5594-9ae2-c616cf743774'}, {'abstract': 'The country star will have concerts at Madison Square Garden and Nassau Coliseum, part of a tour she says will be her last.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/28/arts/music/shania-twain-plays-new-york-arenas.html', 'snippet': 'The country star will have concerts at Madison Square Garden and Nassau Coliseum, part of a tour she says will be her last.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The last time Shania Twain embarked on an arena tour, she had a blockbuster album and momentum — as a country star with world-beating pop ambitions and production values to match. That was in 2003, when such a thing felt less familiar. (Taylor Swift was still a couple of years shy of 15.) ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/28/arts/28GUIDE4/28GUIDE4-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 739, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/28/arts/28GUIDE4/28GUIDE4-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 739}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/28/arts/28GUIDE4/28GUIDE4-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 832, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/28/arts/28GUIDE4/28GUIDE4-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1664, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/28/arts/28GUIDE4/28GUIDE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/28/arts/28GUIDE4/28GUIDE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/28/arts/28GUIDE4/28GUIDE4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbL