ag, but now let’s pivot from symbolic moves to substantial ones.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Suppose African-Americans marked their heritage with flags depicting Nat Turner’s rebellion of 1831, in which slaves massacred about 60 whites before the uprising was crushed? The flag wouldn’t be celebrating the murder of whites, of course, but would simply commemorate a factual milestone in black history!', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/kristof-circular/kristof-circular-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/kristof-circular/kristof-circular-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/kristof-circular/kristof-circular-thumbLarge-v7.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/kristof-circular/kristof-circular-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/kristof-circular/kristof-circular-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 597}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/kristof-circular/kristof-circular-jumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 1019, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/kristof-circular/kristof-circular-superJumbo-v5.jpg', 'he