nd the long-term detention of mothers with children caught crossing the border illegally by allowing most to be released on bond.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a sharp change of policy, Homeland Security officials announced plans Wednesday to end the long-term detention of mothers with children caught crossing the border illegally by allowing most of them to be released quickly on bond.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. to Reduce Long Stays for Families at Immigration Centers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. to Reduce Long Stays for Families at Borders', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Preston, Julia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration Detention', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Homeland Security Department', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Dilley (Tex)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-25T00:06:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julia Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4782eeee-0392-5ac6-8b6e-85edb19779c1', 'word_count': 760, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4782eeee-0392-5ac6-8b6e-85edb19779c1'}, {'abstract': 'Federal prosecutors charged Ercan Findikoglu, who fought extradition from a German jail for 18 months, with computer intrusion, bank and wire fraud conspiracy and money laundering.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/25/business/suspect-in-55-million-atm-scheme-is-extradited-to-us.html', 'snippet': 'Federal prosecutors charged Ercan Findikoglu, who fought extradition from a German jail for 18 months, with computer intrusion, bank and wire fraud conspiracy and money laundering.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A man who prosecutors say orchestrated one of the biggest bank thefts in American history faced charges in the United States after fighting extradition from a German jail for a year and a half.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Suspect in $55 Million A.T.M. Scheme Is Extradited to U.S.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Suspect in an A.T.M. Scheme Is Extradited to the U.S.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cyberattacks and Hackers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Findikoglu, Ercan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bank Robberies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Robberies and Thefts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-25T00:06:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dino Grandoni', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dino', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grandoni', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ef4a1c7a-4b4b-5e76-81f7-07905167f9f7', 'word_count': 454, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef4a1c7a-4b4b-5e76-81f7-07905167f9f7'}, {'abstract': 'When one of her works was criticized as sentimental, Ms. Schapiro said in an interview that sentiment was powerful to her although it was devalued by men.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/25/arts/design/miriam-schapiro-91-a-feminist-artist-who-harnessed-craft-and-pattern-dies.html', 'snippet': 'When one of her works was criticized as sentimental, Ms. Schapiro said in an interview that sentiment was powerful to her although it was devalued by men.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Miriam Schapiro, a pioneering feminist artist who, with Judy Chicago, created the landmark installation “Womanhouse” in Los Angeles in the early 1970s and later in that decade helped found the Pattern and Decoration movement, died on Saturday in Hampton Bays, N.Y. She was 91.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/arts/25schapiro-obit/25schapiro-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/25/arts/25schapiro-obit/25schapiro-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/arts/25schapiro-obit/25schapiro-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/arts/25schapiro-obit/25schapiro-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 974, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/arts/25schapiro-obit/25schapiro-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/25/arts/25schapiro-obit/25schapiro-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidt