.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/25/business/whole-foods-accused-of-overcharging-in-new-york-city-stores.html', 'snippet': 'The New York Department of Consumer Affairs said the grocery chain sold prepackaged products labeled with incorrect weights in its nine city locations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New York Department of Consumer Affairs accused Whole Foods Market on Wednesday of overstating the weight of some prepackaged products sold in the company’s stores in the city.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Whole Foods Accused of Overcharging in New York City Stores', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Business Briefing; Whole Foods Market Accused of Overcharging in New York', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Whole Foods Market Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Strom, Stephanie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Consumer Affairs Department (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Supermarkets and Grocery Stores', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fines (Penalties)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-25T00:47:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephanie Strom', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephanie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Strom', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e78063d-2416-5048-bc8f-cd58a8dbf807', 'word_count': 422, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e78063d-2416-5048-bc8f-cd58a8dbf807'}, {'abstract': 'A report released by New York City’s comptroller, Scott M. Stringer, found that apartments remai