njures or kills a pedestrian or cyclist.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/25/nyregion/union-pushing-to-amend-traffic-law-for-bus-drivers.html', 'snippet': 'Transport Workers Union Local 100 is seeking to exclude bus drivers from a new law that made failure to yield a misdemeanor if a driver injures or kills a pedestrian or cyclist.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A long line of buses inched slowly along 181st Street, snarling traffic in Washington Heights during the morning commute.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/nyregion/25BUSEScity/25BUSEScity-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/25/nyregion/25BUSEScity/25BUSEScity-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/nyregion/25BUSEScity/25BUSEScity-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/nyregion/25BUSEScity/25BUSEScity-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1294, 'width': 1942, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/nyregion/25BUSEScity/25BUSEScity-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/25/nyregion/25BUSEScity/25BUSEScity-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/nyregion/25BUSEScity/25BUSEScity-thumbLar