ticle/e6367510-a1f8-5382-af5b-de60d5bd238f'}, {'abstract': 'Nobody knows what destructive forces could be unleashed if Greece fails to resolve its crisis, and Bulgaria — home to several Greek-owned banks — has much to lose.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/26/world/europe/bulgaria-fears-fallout-from-greeces-financial-troubles.html', 'snippet': 'Nobody knows what destructive forces could be unleashed if Greece fails to resolve its crisis, and Bulgaria — home to several Greek-owned banks — has much to lose.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SOFIA, Bulgaria — When Greece looked as if it might default on its debts early this year, Nikolay Stoyanov, a Bulgarian financial journalist, decided he had had enough of “Greek madness.” So he withdrew his modest savings from one of four big Greek-owned banks that do business in Bulgaria and moved it to his wife’s account at a German-owned lender.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Despite Assurances, Bulgaria Fears a Spillover of Troubles From Greece', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Despite Assurances, Bulgaria Fears a Spillover of Troubles From Greece ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bulgaria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Higgins, Andrew', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greece', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Relocation of Business', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Euro (Currency)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Plevneliev, Rosen', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2