e same story that is in the first book, but from Christian Grey’s point of view.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/26/books/review-grey-fifty-shades-as-told-by-christian-by-e-l-james.html', 'snippet': 'E. L. James continues to mine the “Fifty Shades of Grey” franchise, delivering the same story that is in the first book, but from Christian Grey’s point of view.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Condolences to the 1.1 million people who rushed out to buy E. L. James’s “Grey” in the first four days after its United States publication. All you got was a rehash of “Fifty Shades of Grey,” the first grand-slam effort by the same author (word used advisedly) to turn soft-core bondage porn into an e-book bonanza. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/26/arts/0626BOOKJAMESJP/0626BOOKJAMESJP-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 764, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/26/arts/0626BOOKJAMESJP/0626BOOKJAMESJP-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 764}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/26/arts/0626BOOKJAMESJP/0626BOOKJAMESJP-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 804, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/26/arts/0626BOOKJAMESJP/0626BOOKJAMESJP-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1475, 'width': 1158, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/26/arts/0626BOOKJAMESJP/0626BOOKJAMESJP-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/