ytimes.com/2015/06/28/books/review/the-female-gaze.html', 'snippet': 'Young artists are examining girlhood in the age of the social media fun house.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last year, the pop star Rihanna posted a series of photographs on Instagram from a shoot for the French magazine Lui. In the photos, she’s sporting striking tan lines — and little else. Instagram objected, and the photos were deleted. Shortly after, Rihanna posted another image of herself, this time Photoshopped into a demure yellow brocade jacket, emblazoned with the caption “Rih’s next magazine cover if it was up to Instagram.” Then, she deleted her account for about six months.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '37', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/28/books/review/28WORTHAM/28WORTHAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 743, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/28/books/review/28WORTHAM/28WORTHAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 743}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/28/books/review/28WORTHAM/28WORTHAM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 827, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/28/books/review/28WORTHAM/28WORTHAM-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1654, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/28/books/review/28WORTHAM/28WORTHAM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/28/books/review/28WORTHAM/28WORTHAM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhe