3200'}, {'abstract': 'The decision put an end to a preposterous legal claim and made a powerful defense of the law that has helped millions pay for health insurance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/26/opinion/the-supreme-court-saves-obamacare-again.html', 'snippet': 'The decision put an end to a preposterous legal claim and made a powerful defense of the law that has helped millions pay for health insurance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Thursday morning, for the second time in three years, a majority of the Supreme Court rightly rejected a blatantly political effort to destroy the Affordable Care Act. The case challenging the law, King v. Burwell, was always an ideological farce dressed in a specious legal argument, and the court should never have taken review of it to begin with.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/26/opinion/26fri1art/26fri1-1435264739685-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/26/opinion/26fri1art/26fri1-1435264739685-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 745}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/26/opinion/26fri1art/26fri1-1435264739685-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 826, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/26/opinion/26fri1art/26fri1-1435264739685-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1199, 'width': 966, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/26/opinion/26fri1art/26fri1-1435264739685-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 