.com/2015/06/25/carla-korbes-joins-l-a-dance-project/', 'snippet': 'Ms. Körbes, who just retired as a principal dancer at the Pacific Northwest Ballet, will become the associate artistic director in Los Angeles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Carla Körbes, who recently retired as a principal dancer at the Pacific Northwest Ballet, has been appointed associate artistic director of the L.A. Dance Project, the company announced on Wednesday. She will oversee daily rehearsals, casting and programming, and report directly to Benjamin Millepied, the former New York City Ballet principal and current director of the Paris Opera Ballet, who founded the troupe in 2012.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/26/arts/25artsbeat-ballet1/25artsbeat-ballet1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 383, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/26/arts/25artsbeat-ballet1/25artsbeat-ballet1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 383}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/26/arts/25artsbeat-ballet1/25artsbeat-ballet1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 654, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/26/arts/25artsbeat-ballet1/25artsbeat-ballet1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 654, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/26/arts/25artsbeat-ballet1/25artsbeat-ballet1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/26/arts/25artsbeat-ballet1/25artsbeat-ballet1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/26/arts/25artsbeat-ballet1/25artsbeat-ballet1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Carla Körbes Joins L.A. Dance Project', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Korbes, Carla', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LA Dance Project', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-25T18:36:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roslyn Sulcas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roslyn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sulcas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0c16bd31-113b-5fc4-87a8-61d0b684327a', 'word_count': 246, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0c16bd31-113b-5fc4-87a8-61d0b684327a'}, {'abstract': 'This season, the metal-edged cut-outs usually reserved for ventilation have popped up as a graphic adornment at Alexander McQueen, Prada and Raf Simons.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/25/spring-2016-mens-trend-grommets/', 'snippet': 'This season, the metal-edged cut-outs usually reserved for ventilation have popped up as a graphic adornment at Alexander McQueen, Prada and Raf Simons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Grommets — those metal-edged cut-outs usually reserved for ventilation in a trench coat or for adjusting a belt size — have transcended their functional role to become a graphic adornment in many of the best looks at the men’s wear shows this season. Earlier in London, Alexander McQueen showed a coat covered in oversize ones; while in Milan at Prada, a classic pleated skirt was toughened up by their addition. And last night in Paris, Raf Simons showed multiple coats and jackets with repeating patterns of grommets in Y, V and diamond shapes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/t-magazine/25trend-grommets-rider/25trend-grommets-rider-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/25/t-magazine/25trend-grommets-rider/25trend-grommets-rider-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/t-magazine/25trend-grommets-rider/25trend-grommets-rider-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/t-magazine/25trend-grommets-rider/25trend-grommets-rider-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1125, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/t-magazine/25trend-grommets-rider/25trend-grommets-rider-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/25/t-magazine/25trend-grommets-rider/25trend-grommets-rider-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/t-magazine/25trend-grommets-rider/25trend-grommets-rider-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'At the Spring 2016 Men’s Wear Shows, Grommets Are the Embellishm