/2015/06/26/world/asia/india-severe-flooding-kills-dozens.html', 'snippet': 'At least 41 people have been killed in severe flooding caused by heavy monsoon rains that have lashed part of the western state of Gujarat.', 'lead_paragraph': ' At least 41 people have been killed in severe flooding caused by heavy monsoon rains that have lashed part of the western state of Gujarat, officials said Thursday. Thousands of houses were destroyed in seven districts in the southwestern part of Gujarat, said Bipin Bhatt, the director of the state’s disaster management authority. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'India: Severe Flooding Kills Dozens', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Asia; India: Severe Flooding Kills Dozens', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bearak, Max', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Floods', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gujarat State (India)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Monsoons', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-26T01:33:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Max Bearak', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Max', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bearak', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/232a5af7-0e2f-5a7d-bab4-30ffd207312e', 'word_count': 53, 'uri': 'nyt://article/232a5af7-0e2f-5a7d-bab4-30ffd207312e'}, {'abstract': 'The manic opening minutes of Thursday’s draft at Barclays Center spawned one of the most entertaining first round