r life decision in the past year for financial reasons, mainly because they lack sufficient savings or are worried about the economy, or both, a new survey finds.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Americans Are Delaying Major Life Events Because of Money Worries', 'kicker': 'Your Money Adviser', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Putting Off Life&#8217;s Big Decisions Until Bank Accounts Are Fuller', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Savings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN INSTITUTE OF CERTIFIED PUBLIC ACCOUNTANTS', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-26T12:04:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/fd7aacef-bca1-561e-a50c-57f51b850ddd', 'word_count': 719, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fd7aacef-bca1-561e-a50c-57f51b850ddd'}, {'abstract': 'Some states ban happy hour deals for promoting excessive drinking and drunken driving. Should more do so?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/roomfordebate/2015/06/26/should-happy-hour-be-banned', 'snippet': 'Some states ban happy hour deals for promoting excessive drinking and drunken driving. Should more do so?', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge