ergarten, and I couldn’t get a good answer to my question.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/26/a-kindergarten-form-asks-vaginal-birth-or-c-section-why/', 'snippet': 'I couldn’t imagine why anyone would ask this of an ordinary 5-year-old entering kindergarten, and I couldn’t get a good answer to my question.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My husband fills out most of the forms in our marriage. So when we received a humongous packet of forms at a kindergarten prematriculation session, he immediately got to work. Hunched over the voluminous pile, he meticulously yet mindlessly checked little boxes and filled in the blanks. But a question I just happened to glance caught my attention: ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/us/motherlode-paiuk-forms/motherlode-paiuk-forms-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/22/us/motherlode-paiuk-forms/motherlode-paiuk-forms-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/us/motherlode-paiuk-forms/motherlode-paiuk-forms-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 677, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/us/motherlode-paiuk-forms/motherlode-paiuk-forms-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1353, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/22/us/motherlode-paiuk-forms/motherlode-paiuk-forms-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/22/