s defining luxury item may well be a track suit or pair of tiny, shiny shorts.) The love for the ballers, it seems, is mutual: another trend that’s only gaining steam is the appearance of athletes like Carmelo Anthony and Amar’e Stoudemire at men’s fashion week shows and parties, having left their jerseys at home in favor of sharp, dapper duds. Game recognize game, after all.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/t-magazine/25trend-sport-farber/25trend-sport-farber-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/25/t-magazine/25trend-sport-farber/25trend-sport-farber-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/t-magazine/25trend-sport-farber/25trend-sport-farber-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/t-magazine/25trend-sport-farber/25trend-sport-farber-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/t-magazine/25trend-sport-farber/25trend-sport-farber-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/25/t-magazine/25trend-sport-farber/25trend-sport-farber-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/25/t-magazine/25trend-sport-farber/25trend-sport-farber-thu