 at the Abrons Arts Center.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For those who like their music extra durational, it’s a rich week in New York. The Bang on a Can Marathon provided nearly 11 eclectic hours this past Sunday, and this coming Sunday the Whitney Museum of American Art is presenting — over eight hours — Conlon Nancarrow’s complete studies for player piano.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/27/arts/27ELECTROACOUSTIC/27ELECTROACOUSTIC-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/27/arts/27ELECTROACOUSTIC/27ELECTROACOUSTIC-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/27/arts/27ELECTROACOUSTIC/27ELECTROACOUSTIC-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/27/arts/27ELECTROACOUSTIC/27ELECTROACOUSTIC-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/27/arts/27ELECTROACOUSTIC/27ELECTROACOUSTIC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/27/arts/27ELECTROACOUSTIC/27ELECTROACOUSTIC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/27/arts/27ELECTROACOUSTIC/27ELECTROACOUSTIC-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thum