, 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News Analysis', '_id': 'nyt://article/35827c68-e30e-5cdd-ba6a-ff39248c7869', 'word_count': 1579, 'uri': 'nyt://article/35827c68-e30e-5cdd-ba6a-ff39248c7869'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Mascara’s persistent lobbying once came a veto pen away from succeeding, but always remained out of reach.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/27/nyregion/red-mascara-whose-song-im-from-new-jersey-almost-became-a-state-anthem-dies-at-92.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Mascara’s persistent lobbying once came a veto pen away from succeeding, but always remained out of reach.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Red Mascara, who became New Jersey’s most persistent lobbyist with his 55-year bid to make a ditty he had written the official song of the state of Sinatra and Springsteen, died on June 20 at his home in Phillipsburg, N.J. He was 92.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/27/arts/27MASCARA-obit/27MASCARA-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/27/arts/27MASCARA-obit/27MASCARA-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 433}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/27/arts/27MASCARA-obit/27MASCARA-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 739, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/27/arts/27MASCARA-obit/27MASCARA-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1479, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/27/arts/27MASCARA-obit/27MASCARA-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/27/arts/27MASCARA-obit/27MASCARA-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/27/arts/27MASCARA-obit/27MASCARA-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Red Mascara, 92, Dies; His ‘I’m From New Jersey’ Almost Became State Song', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Red Mascara, 92, Whose Song Almost Became a State Anthem', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zernike, Kate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mascara, Red', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-27T02:55:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Zernike', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zernike', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/c3a6ff05-b31f-5ae2-ad28-fae05dc347f1', 'word_count': 510, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c3a6ff05-b31f-5ae2-ad28-fae05dc347f1'}, {'abstract': 'Thousands, including parents, babies and dogs, flocked to the Supreme Court after its ruling on same-sex marriage. Supporters spoke about how they thought the ruling helped maintain and support families.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/100000003767426/a-victory-for-children-too.html', 'snippet': 'T