-bride-there-in-spirit.html', 'snippet': 'A bride, whose great-grandfather wrote “The Father of the Bride," marries with her own father there in spirit only.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sarah Elizabeth Streeter, a daughter of Jennifer Lautenbach Streeter of Atlanta and the late E. Daniel Streeter, was married Saturday afternoon in Nantucket, Mass., to Henry David Hutcheson, a son of Susanne Lilly Hutcheson and Zenas W. Hutcheson III of Minneapolis. The Rev. Dr. Gary W. Klingsporn performed the ceremony at the First Congregational Church, of which he is the senior minister.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/28/fashion/weddings/28STREETER/28STREETER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/28/fashion/weddings/28STREETER/28STREETER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/28/fashion/weddings/28STREETER/28STREETER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 746, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/28/fashion/weddings/28STREETER/28STREETER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1447, 'width': 1986, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/28/fashion/weddings/28STREETER/28STREETER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/28/fashion/weddings/28STREETER/28STREETER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge