6-a863-5433623620de'}, {'abstract': 'Brett Gardner and Garrett Jones allowed a ball to drop between them in the outfield, helping the Astros gain a split of a weekend series.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/29/sports/collin-mchugh-baffles-yankees-hitters-as-astros-win-series-finale.html', 'snippet': 'Brett Gardner and Garrett Jones allowed a ball to drop between them in the outfield, helping the Astros gain a split of a weekend series.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — One of the most rudimentary drills at the most elementary levels of baseball involves learning how to handle a fly ball hit between fielders. There are rules that dictate which fielders have priority. Sometimes coded words are used — not simply “I’ve got it” — to erase any confusion.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/29/sports/29yankees1/29yankees1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/29/sports/29yankees1/29yankees1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 375}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/29/sports/29yankees1/29yankees1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 641, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/29/sports/29yankees1/29yankees1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1251, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/29/sports/29yankees1/29yankees1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/0