boration.', 'lead_paragraph': '“All the world’s a stage,And all the men and women merely players:They have their exits and their entrances;And one man in his time plays many parts,His acts being seven ages.” — Jacques, “As You Like It”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In a Triumphant Shout', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-28T22:00:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ca11a307-88dc-56c8-81a9-af533ad4dccf', 'word_count': 538, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ca11a307-88dc-56c8-81a9-af533ad4dccf'}, {'abstract': 'Shirking the obligation to protect refugees betrays our core values.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/29/opinion/youre-better-than-this-europe.html', 'snippet': 'Shirking the obligation to protect refugees betrays our core values.', 'lead_paragraph': 'STRASBOURG, France — DURING the last seven decades, European countries have painstakingly tried to rebuild a continent once shattered by war and atrocities according to the values of solidarity and human rights. We built institutions to prevent the crimes of the past and we made a commitment to help those in need of protection.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/29/opinion/29Muiznieks/29Muiznieks-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 862, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'lega