mullyan/', 'snippet': 'Celebrate the 150th anniversary of Alice in Wonderland with this challenge by master puzzler Raymond Smullyan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week we mark the 150th anniversary of the publication of Lewis Carroll’s\xa0“Alice’s Adventures in Wonderland” with a special feature by Raymond Smullyan, the famed musician, magician, mathematician, logician and\xa0professor emeritus of philosophy at Indiana University.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Raymond Smullyan’s ‘Alice in Puzzle-Land’', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mathematics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Numbers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Puzzles', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carroll, Lewis', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dover Publications', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indiana University', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-29T16:00:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gary Antonick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Antonick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/685fbe90-7514-5e96-b299-e05bbf15f667', 'word_count': 1380, 'uri': 'nyt://article/685fbe90-7514-5e96-b299-e05bbf15f667'}, {'abstract': 'Police in Cairo on Monday inspected the wreckage of a convoy carrying Egypt’s top prosecutor, Hisham Barakat, who was killed by the attack.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/middleeast/100000003770842/aftermath-of-egypt-prosecutor-bombing.html', 'snippet': 'Police in Cairo on Monday inspected the wreckage of a convoy carry