, if you want to get biblical about it.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Old-World Dinner Pairs Barolo and Roasted Goat', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Old-World Dinner Pairing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Asimov, Eric', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Meat', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wines', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Goats', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Magazino, John', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mar, Angela (Chef)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-29T16:52:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Asimov', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Asimov', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/356fed36-0384-58f2-8930-9044761e8e85', 'word_count': 331, 'uri': 'nyt://article/356fed36-0384-58f2-8930-9044761e8e85'}, {'abstract': 'Roberto Faraone Mennella called on his experience as an architect for his brand’s latest collection.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/06/29/faraone-mennella-screw-ring/', 'snippet': 'Roberto Faraone Mennella called on his experience as an architect for his brand’s latest collection.', 'lead_paragraph': '“To be completely honest,” explains Amedeo Scognamiglio of the Italian fine jewelry brand Faraone Mennella’s inner workings, “Roberto, my business partner, is also an architect — he designed all of our shops and our showroom. And I always say that we keep opening stores to make Roberto happy, so he can build them.” That know-how led to the creation of a standout ring from the duo’s Capri Girl collection, a curved, diamond-encrusted screw in gold or silver. “We’ve always been nongraphic, very feminine and romantic,” Scognamiglio says, “so this marks an evolution” — a little bit Dolce Vita, a little bit rock ‘n’ roll.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/29/t-magazine/29feelingfor-Faraone/29feelingfor-Faraone-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/29/t-magazine/29feelingfor-Faraone/29feelingfor-Faraone-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 660}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/29/t-magazine/29feelingfor-Faraone/29feelingfor-Faraone-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 931, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/29/t-magazine/29feelingfor-Faraone/29feelingfor-Faraone-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1862, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/29/t-magazine/29feelingfor-Faraone/29feelingfor-Faraone-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/29/t-magazine/29feelingfor-Faraone/29feelingfor-Faraone-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/29/t-magazine/29feelingfor-Faraone/29feelingfor-Faraone-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name