 in return for new Iranian concessions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/06/30/world/us-tells-iran-that-preliminary-nuclear-deal-must-stand.html', 'snippet': 'A senior American official declined to say if the United States might agree to adjust some elements of the Lausanne framework in return for new Iranian concessions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VIENNA — The United States warned Iran on Monday, in both English and Persian, that a preliminary agreement reached two months ago in Switzerland must remain the basis for a final nuclear deal. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/world/30DIPLO/30DIPLO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 383, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/30/world/30DIPLO/30DIPLO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 383}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/world/30DIPLO/30DIPLO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 654, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/world/30DIPLO/30DIPLO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1308, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/world/30DIPLO/30DIPLO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/30/world/30DIPLO/30DIPLO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/world/30DIPLO/30DIPLO-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height':