— even at the bar.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/01/world/americas/argentine-city-aims-to-stand-out-with-rebellious-spirit-and-coke-in-a-cup.html', 'snippet': 'Residents of Córdoba, a city of 1.3 million in the interior, pride themselves on doing things differently from their countrymen — even at the bar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CÓRDOBA, Argentina — Backstage at a dance hall, a percussionist, Hugo Núñez, unzipped his rucksack and pulled out two bottles: one of fernet, a bitter Italian liqueur, the other of Coca-Cola. After mixing them in a plastic pint glass, Mr. Núñez sank his lips into the sepia-colored froth and guzzled. That Friday night, the sequence would be repeated by young revelers in bars and dance halls across this city.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/world/01CORDOBA/01CORDOBA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/30/world/01CORDOBA/01CORDOBA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/world/01CORDOBA/01CORDOBA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/world/01CORDOBA/01CORDOBA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 1082, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/world/01CORDOBA/01CORDOBA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/30/world/01CORDOBA/01CORDOBA-