and as a strong leader for a nation craving authority after years of fecklessness and weakness.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/06/30/the-chat-chris-christies-announcement-speech-instantly-analyzed/', 'snippet': 'Chris Christie cast himself as an anti-Washington candidate and as a strong leader for a nation craving authority after years of fecklessness and weakness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gov. Chris Christie of New Jersey announced his campaign for the 2016 Republican presidential nomination\xa0on Tuesday with a speech at his old high school in Livingston, N.J. Over instant messages, two New York Times political correspondents analyzed Mr. Christie’s remarks in real time, as they did with the campaign announcements of\xa0several\xa0other\xa02016\xa0candidates. Here is an edited version of their chat.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/us/politics/30firstdraft-christie3/30firstdraft-christie3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/30/us/politics/30firstdraft-christie3/30firstdraft-christie3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/us/politics/30firstdraft-christie3/30firstdraft-christie3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/us/politics/30firstdraft-christie3/30firstdraft-christie3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/us/politics/30firstdr