15/07/01/dining/bluefish-april-bloomfield.html', 'snippet': 'The chef April Bloomfield makes a case for the bluefish, an underrated local treat that is as satisfying to cook as it is to catch.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I love fishing, though I have to admit I’m not very technical. I pick up tips where I can and somehow still manage to catch fish.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/01/dining/01FISH1/01FISH1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 707, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/01/dining/01FISH1/01FISH1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 707}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/01/dining/01FISH1/01FISH1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 869, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/01/dining/01FISH1/01FISH1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1738, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/01/dining/01FISH1/01FISH1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/01/dining/01FISH1/01FISH1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/01/dining/01FISH1/01FISH1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Chef and Her Bluefish', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Ch