ain': 'Cuba Wins W.H.O. Certification It Ended Mother-to-Child H.I.V. Transmission', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'World Briefing | Health; Cuba: Mother-to-Child Transmission of H.I.V. Is Eliminated, W.H.O. Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cuba', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Acquired Immune Deficiency Syndrome', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Syphilis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Health Organization', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-30T17:02:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Donald G. McNeil Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Donald', 'middlename': 'G.', 'lastname': 'McNeil', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3323810c-a796-5245-b3a6-2ce48fb90aef', 'word_count': 147, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3323810c-a796-5245-b3a6-2ce48fb90aef'}, {'abstract': 'A federal appeals court said it agreed with a 2013 decision that Apple conspired with publishers to raise prices for e-books.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/01/technology/ruling-that-apple-led-e-book-pricing-conspiracy-is-upheld.html', 'snippet': 'A federal appeals court said it agreed with a 2013 decision that Apple conspired with publishers to raise prices for e-books.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — A federal appeals court on Tuesday upheld a ruling that determined Apple to be the leader of an industrywide conspiracy among book publishers to raise prices of digital books.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ruling That Apple Led E-Book Pricing Conspiracy Is\xa0Upheld', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ruling T