n March, security officials said Tuesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/01/world/africa/gunman-at-tunisian-beach-hotel-trained-with-museum-attackers.html', 'snippet': 'The man who killed 38 people last week had spent time in a militant camp in Libya, overlapping with two men who killed 22 in March, security officials said Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TUNIS — The gunman who massacred 38 foreign tourists at a beachside hotel on Friday trained with a militant group in Libya this year alongside two Tunisians who later killed 22 people at the national museum, security officials confirmed on Tuesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gunman at Tunisian Beach Hotel Trained With Museum Attackers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gunmen in 2 Tunisia Raids Trained Together in Libya', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gall, Carlotta', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tunisia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Erlanger, Steven', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rezgui, Seifeddine (d 2015 )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tunis (Tunisia)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-06-30T20:07:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carlotta Gall and Steven Erlanger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carlotta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Erlanger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': '